        {
            id = 1220487,
            score = 16,
            author = "Jakobud",
            text = "Two important changes to this quest in Cataclysm\n\nSharptalon is now level 22.  Easy to kill.\nThe Ashenvale Hunt quest no longer exists and is therefore no longer a prerequisite.  Simply kill Sharptalon and you will get the quest item.",
