            author = "BossInvader",
            text = "After you acquire this quest, make sure you talk to Marshal Dugham (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=240) again.  He will offer you to ride the Stormwind Charger (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=42260) for free as a much faster way to get to Guard Thomas (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=261) for the quest.\n\nI'm only mentioning this as I sort of breeze through quests and never read the text, I never noticed this till quite a while after Cataclysm launched and I started another human alt on a different realm.",
