            author = "5858",
            text = "The guards are dead and you're pretty much finding their remains, the first one is to the left of the river flowing south from the lake, the other one is by the murlocs. This one is hard to get because he is surrounded by 3 or 4 murlocs that like to aggro friends. It's much easier if you have a group.",
