            text = "Coords: 72, 60",
            date = "2007-01-29T15:30:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=37#comments:id=27223",
        },
        {
            id = 989342,
            score = 10,
            author = "553140",
            text = "OK, so as a level 45 Draenei Hunter, the quests in this area are mainly for me to build up reputation with Stormwind, because I really want an Epic Stallion Mount.  So the quests include easy kills.  But this quest had me stumped.  I knew I was looking for the missing guards or signs of remains.  On the western shore is a dead guard, but not one you want.  What you should be looking for is extremely easy to miss because it looks like the surrounding vegetation.  One guard's remains are on the western bank, and they look like a partial rib cage and part of a pant leg, and are very easy to miss, even when standing on them.  Same for the remains of the other guard on the Murlock side, the east.  At my level, the kills were instantaneous, but I did not know what to look for.  Both sets of remains are on the ground, in the open, and near the yellow arrow you will see.  But, like I said, they are very easy to miss.  Should be an easy quest if you start at the bridge off of the road and go up the left side to find the first set of remains, then cross the water to the murlock village for the other set which is set up near some tents going up the hill.",
            date = "2010-03-03T00:46:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=37#comments:id=989342",
