            text = "If you head into the fargodeep mine which is south of Goldshire but not too far down, you will find lots of \"kobolds\".  These guys are small and have candles on their heads.  They drop gold dust every so often and that is what you need to collect.  Fairly easy but for safety I recommend you take one person with you to help you clear the Fargodeep Mine.",
            date = "2006-12-10T17:01:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=47#comments:id=12880",
