            date = "2006-11-26T05:21:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=176#comments:id=4572",
        },
        {
            id = 19962,
            score = 43,
            author = "11751",
            text = "This is the first \"elite\" quest in the human storyline. This is best in a group or you will most likely die from adds, extra monsters attacking you.\n\nOnce Hogger is dead have everyone in your party loot his body and pick up his claw, it will be available to everyone that has the quest in your party.",
            date = "2007-01-09T19:35:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=176#comments:id=19962",
        },
        {
            id = 15050,
            score = 26,
            author = "SeriusJones",
            text = "It's pretty tough to solo this at level 10ish.  I recommend finding at least one more, AND clearing the roaming gnolls.  Also, avoid the camps, they have a rather large radius of aggro :)\n\n- SJ",
            date = "2006-12-13T17:10:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=176#comments:id=15050",
        },
        {
            id = 1184561,
            score = 23,
            author = "519724",
            text = "In the Cataclysm version of this quest, you don't kill Hogger, you just bring him down to 1 hp. After that General Marcus Jonathan (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46942) appears with some backup and arrests Hogger, which is the explanation as to why he also can be found in the Stockade (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46254).",
            date = "2010-11-25T10:43:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=176#comments:id=1184561",
        },
    },
    [182] = {
        {
            id = 1414329,
            score = 19,
            author = "795703",
            text = "This is one quest that freaks me out.  We are killing young trolls, they're more like teenagers than children, and they are fighting the dwarves and gnomes, but still.  Trolling For Information (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24489) confirmed they were going to set a Fire Elemental on us, but that they were also scared out of their wits too.\n\nCompare that to To Be Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26115), where Overlord Krom'gar dropped a huge bomb on a school, whose students were probably the same age, and Garrosh Hellscream of all people shows up and executes Krom'gar for the despicable act.\n\nWHAT THE **** AM I DOING?",
            date = "2011-05-09T22:15:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=182#comments:id=1414329",
        },
        {
