            author = "Yeoman",
            text = "Followup of this quest chain is Big Game Hunter (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=208), but available only after completing all 3 separate quest chains:\n\nTiger Mastery (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=188) (this quest) Raptor Mastery (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=197)\nPanther Mastery (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=190)",
