        {
            id = 254839,
            score = 7,
            author = "39998",
            text = "For those without a Coordinate reader or whatnot…\n\n1. The cave entrance is at the bottom of the \"Coldridge Valley\" map. You can see the landmark on the map and it looks like a typical mining cave entrance.\n\n2. When you enter the cave, just take the left trail..\n\n3. Kill all of the trolls you encounter, otherwise you may find yourself running back via ghost form.\n\nTips:\n-The troll next to Grik'nir the Cold, all of the times I've done this quest, pulls Grik'nir when you attack him or vise-versa.. I would suggest blasting Grik'nir with all you have, looting, and try to kill the other troll.",
            date = "2008-03-17T14:10:35-05:00",
