        },
        {
            id = 5425987,
            score = 6,
            author = "glassleo",
            text = "Lots of old misinformation on this page for how to get this breadcrumb quest... You do not have to complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=62 or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=76 to get this.\n\nAll you need to do is the missing guard quest chain starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40 and ending with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=59. You can do all of this at level 1 with a freshly created Alliance character, there are no other prerequisites.\n\nSince it's a breadcrumb for Westbrook Garrison, you also cannot get this if you have already completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11, unless you Party Sync with someone who hasn't done the Elwynn quests and do the entire https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40 chain again while in Party Sync. The 15 year old top comment on this page (as of writing this) is wrong.\n\nI spent a good chunk of time testing this so hopefully it helps someone out there who is missing this quest!",
            date = "2022-08-30T12:23:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=239#comments:id=5425987",
        },
        {
            id = 720448,
            score = 4,
            author = "Elamir",
            text = "Westbrook Garrison is here (http://www.wowhead.com/?maps=12:246728).\nAlso, theres a path leading up from the back of the Garrison, which  would eventually bring you to Thunder Falls (http://www.wowwiki.com/Thunder_Falls).",
            date = "2009-05-18T23:45:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=239#comments:id=720448",
