            text = "If you're a little over powered for this quest, let Huldar take a couple of hits from the traitor Saean before you wail on him, otherwise you might kill him too fast for the quest objective to complete.  If you happen to bug it, and you end up standing there after Saean is dead for a good 30 seconds or so, abandon the quest and wait for the guys to repop, then get the quest again (no need to run back to town) and then do it with the aforementioned tip, then finish Saean off.  It should finish normally then and you'll be prompted to run off to the next camp.",
