            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=384#comments:id=108384",
        },
        {
            id = 342241,
            score = 7,
            author = "Archaeic",
            text = "If you are having trouble completing this quest, don't worry. Kill boars that you see while questing (A Favour for Evershine comes to mind, as it has you kill plenty of boars) and you should end up with all the ribs. Personally I keep forgetting to hand in, so I have ended up with a surplus. Oh well.",
            date = "2008-08-01T15:07:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=384#comments:id=342241",
        },
        {
            id = 1876511,
            score = 7,
            author = "1132441",
            text = "For this quest, Ragnar Thunderbrew wants four tender boar ribs and a mug of Rhapsody Malt. The boar ribs where very easy to obtain. Just kill the boar's located off the road of Kharanos. The rhapsody malt was a little confusing for me to get. The location on the map is off so do not go by the map. On the quest page, it says you can get the malt from the tavern. Talk to Innkeeper Belm and ask to look through his goods. The first item you will see is the rhapsody malt. Return to Ragnar Thunderbrew at Shimmer Ridge in Dun Morogh to turn in this quest. Hope this helps!",
            date = "2013-07-13T13:15:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=384#comments:id=1876511",
        },
        {
            id = 1463829,
