            text = "Fel Cone's are all around the trees.  You can easily complete this quest by going to Zenn and checking the base of the trees in the area.  Now that quest items on the ground sparkle, this is not hard.  But this isn't remotely hard to begin with :)",
            date = "2008-02-05T14:59:37-06:00",
