        {
            id = 5219753,
            score = 25,
            author = "EXPERIMENTONGOD",
            text = "Note that this quest is TAUREN ONLY.\n\nThis is the only \"Tauren race required Mulgore quest\" as of 9.1 as far as I know.\n\nI wasn't able to pick this up with my Highmountain Tauren.\n\nSo if you're not a \"traditional tauren\" this is where the questline ends for you unfortunately.",
