            author = "glassleo",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=20441 is the prerequisite for picking up this quest.",
            date = "2022-08-31T18:53:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=773#comments:id=5426749",
        },
        {
            id = 331713,
            score = 5,
            author = "159616",
            text = "tried doing this quest on my lvl 6. all you have to do is talk to the spirit so you can just run in and talk to him instead of taking out all the guys.\n\nI don't see how that's possible.  See the screenshot I submitted - he's surrounded by level 9 and 10 Bristleback Interlopers.\n\nAs per the previous post, there's an NPC at 60.0, 25.5 - Lorekeeper Raintotem - who gives you a quest to kill 8 Bristleback Interlopers, so this is a great quest to pick up on your way to do this one.  See my screenshot on the page for that quest (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=833) for what he looks like.\n\nThe Bristleback Interlopers are fairly closely packed near the spirit, and they attempt to run away at low health, so some sort of instant cast spell or stun effect is a must here if you can't handle mobs.",
            date = "2008-07-21T03:16:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=773#comments:id=331713",
        },
    },
