            text = "Fungal Spores (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=5012) are in Laden Mushroom (http://www.wowhead.com/?object=3640#contains) s. You must open it in order to get some Fungal Spores. You can find Fungal Spores on the bank of the lake. There are 13 lvl mobs, but they're standing together so I soloed it at 16lvl.\n\nYou can also accomplish quest The Forgotten Pools (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=870). you must dive in to the lake and there you can find something like a bubble shrine. You must go to the Bubble Shrine and than the quest will be completed.\n\n-Shakman",
