            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1168#comments:id=73920",
        },
        {
            id = 1209820,
            score = 11,
            author = "ShamanKalii",
            text = "So many comments, but no one has asked the obvious question... Tharg's WIFE! There are female Ogres? Was she the last one? Or are some of these Ogres... Oh god.",
            date = "2010-12-06T07:59:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1168#comments:id=1209820",
        },
        {
            id = 211203,
            score = 5,
            author = "arco",
            text = "There's a really easy way to kill a ton of these dragons if you're a ranged character.  On the south side of the Stonemaul Ruins, at about 44, 66, there's a fallen tree that's laying over the remnants of the spiked fence.  If you jump onto the tree and run up to the roots, you can hit almost everything in the big, ruined courtyard area.  If you cast/shoot from up there, the dragonkin have to run all the way around to a certain point, where they can path up to your location.  Usually you can get off 6-8 spells (as a mage) before they even get to you as a result of this pathing.  Very easy, painless kills.",
            date = "2008-01-01T20:50:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1168#comments:id=211203",
        },
        {
