            author = "mashby",
            text = "This quest is a wee bit confusing because you might be thinking, like I did, that the satchel is at a location. It's not. Karnitol's Satchel is a random drop off off Slitherblade Sea Witches and Slitherblade Tidehunters. Don't bother grinding on other Slitherblade naga, only those two will yeild the satchel.\n\nWhat I did was head out to Ranazjar Isle and kill Tidehunters and Sea Witches until the drop.",
            date = "2007-01-27T19:25:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1456#comments:id=25950",
        },
