            author = "Jerakth",
            text = "All of the report quest turn ins are considered repeatable in case you abandon the Warsong Reports Quest http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=6543. You cannot complete them so just exclude them from the quest list. They are also uncounted for Loremaster because of this.",
