        {
            id = 1453665,
            score = 17,
            author = "Sient",
            text = "I'd like to add, from ANY rep you're at on this faction (0/3000) it will take approx. 22 Lava Cores. 2,000 rep per turn in.\n\nNeutral - 3000\nFriendly - 6000\nHonored - 12,000\nRevered - 21,000\nExalted - 999\n\nSooooo,,\n~42,999\n\nCuz no one likes a random number when exalted. ie. Exalted (400/999)\n\nBy the way, this is the cheapest and fastest rep in the game I believe.\n\nDepending on Lava core prices. They shouldn't be past 5g, 7g MAX.",
