            text = "yes, i needed these when my hunter was level 50ish.. i wanted to make a \"heart of the mountain\" and.. well i never did get one.. now my hunter is 70 and its usless..  \"i dont see anyone\" actually spending the time to aquire these.. as no one runs MC/BRS/NAXX/ZG anymore..   unless they are targeting a \"SPECIFIC\" drop like the ZG shoulder/head enchants for thier twinks... Save yourself the trouble.. forget this item existed.   you can make better or wear better VERY SHORTLY..",
            date = "2007-09-20T10:57:18-05:00",
