            text = "You have the ability to complete this quest at revered reputation with the Warsong Outriders (http://www.wowhead.com/?faction=889). This is given by the Warsong Gulch supplier in Ashenvale (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=331). The Outrider Advance Care Package (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=19153) contains 20 Warsong Gulch Enriched Ration (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=19060) and Warsong Gulch Runecloth Bandage (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=19066).",
