            author = "33042",
            text = "Here are the actual mobs with their drop rates.  The drop rates are slightly higher than what is shown because they will not drop for people who are not on the quest or have it completed.\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=23483\n\nAnd yes, they are around 25,75",
