        {
            id = 2285831,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fwd7jPINzto\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423\n•\009Accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16852 at coords 26.8, 37.4 (Northeast of the Temple of Telhamat).\n•\009Travel west to coords 23.0, 40.4, to the Temple of Telhamat, and turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16834.",
            date = "2015-12-09T20:17:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423#comments:id=2285831",
        },
        {
            id = 5399522,
            score = 1,
            author = "HushGlowie",
            text = "This is the second quest in the \"In Search of Sedai\" chapter in Hellfire Peninsula (https://www.wowhead.com/hellfire-peninsula), that begins with the quest In Search of Sedai (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9390/in-search-of-sedai).\n\nThis quest line includes:\n\nIn Search of Sedai (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9390/in-search-of-sedai)\nThis quest is obtained from Anchorite Obedai (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16834/anchorite-obadei) at the Temple of Telhamat.\nFind Sedai's Corpse (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16852/sedais-corpse) to the east and turn in the quest.\nReturn to Obadei (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423/return-to-obadei)\nThis quest is obtained from Sedai's Corpse (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16852/sedais-corpse), just east of the Temple of Telhamat.\nSimply return to Anchorite Obadei (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16834/anchorite-obadei) and turn in the quest. This will trigger some RP.\nMakuru's Vengeance (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9424/makurus-vengeance)\nThis quest is obtained from Makuru (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16833/makuru) at the Temple of Telhamat.\nCollect 10 Mag'har Ancestral Beads (https://www.wowhead.com/item=23589/maghar-ancestral-beads) from the Mag'har Orcs nearby and return to Makuru (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16833/makuru) to turn in the quest. This will trigger some RP.\nSha'naar Relics (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9430/shanaar-relics)\nThis quest is obtained from Amaan The Wise (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16796/amaan-the-wise) at the Temple of Telhamat after some RP involving Amaan and Makuru.\nCollect 10 Sha'naar Relics (https://www.wowhead.com/item=23642/shanaar-relic) from the Ruins of Sha'naar and return to Amaan The Wise (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16796/amaan-the-wise) to turn in the quest.\nAtonement (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9543/atonement)\nThis quest is obtained from Anchorite Obadei (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16834/anchorite-obadei) at the Temple of Telhamat.\nSimply return to Amaan The Wise (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16796/amaan-the-wise) and turn in the quest.\nThe Seer's Relic (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9543/atonement)\nThis quest is obtained from Amaan The Wise (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16796/amaan-the-wise) at the Temple of Telhamat. Return to Sedai's Corpse (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16852/sedais-corpse) and use Seer's Relic (https://www.wowhead.com/item=23645/seers-relic).\nSome RP involving Sedai and some orcs will begin but you don't have to wait for all of it, you can simply return to Amaan The Wise (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16796/amaan-the-wise) and turn in the quest.",
            date = "2022-07-17T18:39:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423#comments:id=5399522",
        },
    },
