            text = "I got it at level 60; so not true. However, It can be done with Cruel Taskmasters (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9399) at approximately (13, 57). The Elite that patrols the area is part of another chain, which ends with Arzeth's Demise (http//www.wowhead.com/?quest=10369). The chain starts with Naladu (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10403), given by Akoru the Firecaller (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20678) at approximately (16, 59).",
