            text = "I believe they have removed the Envoy to the Mag'har quest with patch 4.0.1. So I wonder if this quest line is no longer available or only available once you have reached Friendly with the Mag'har?",
            date = "2010-11-09T20:23:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9442#comments:id=1166674",
        },
        {
            id = 1483182,
            score = 9,
            author = "zids",
            text = "I just got this quest today (I started working on Mag'har reputation yesterday). I'm not sure but I probably did Envoy to the Mag'har (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9441) prior to Cataclysm. So, maybe it requires you to have that quest done (necessarily before Cataclysm since it was removed after it) but I can assure it has not been removed from the game, just maybe impossible to get for characters created after Cataclysm or that did not have completed the aforementioned quest.\n\nEdit: Also, I got 550 rep with Mag'har from it. So the base rep is 500 and not 250.",
            date = "2011-07-30T12:47:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9442#comments:id=1483182",
        },
    },
