        {
            id = 130329,
            score = 15,
            author = "73695",
            text = "Can be done in conjunction with:\n\nThe Great Fissure:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9340\n\nA Debilitating Sickness\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9442",
