        {
            id = 102783,
            score = 12,
            author = "tatterdemalion",
            text = "The mobs guarding him can be pulled without aggroing.",
            date = "2007-06-12T01:40:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9466#comments:id=102783",
        },
        {
            id = 367268,
            score = 6,
            author = "Amento",
            text = "Blacktalon the Savage\nLevel: 63\nClassification: Elite\nHealth: 27,000\n\nSoloed as level 61 Druid\n\nHow to:\n\nClear the two mobs in front of him\nPull with faerie fire and run out of the cave\nEvery time yu go into bear form, use bark skin\nKeep faerie fire and Demoralizing roar up\nPop trinkets when ready\nWhen you are low on HP, Bash run away and root. Then I used Regrowth, Rejuvernation and first aid\nIf your low on mana use Inervate.\nIf you have alot of mana, cast some moonfire and wrath while he is rooted\nWhen root wears out, cast barkskin again and continue fighting\n\nHope this helps\n\n~Amento",
            date = "2008-09-02T05:27:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9466#comments:id=367268",
        },
    },
    [9472] = {
        {
            id = 13020,
            score = 339,
            author = "Sware",
            text = "West of Falcon Watch is the next zone, Zangarmarsh, and right when you enter the zone there is a camp called Cenarion Refuge.\n\nIn the inn is the Inn Keeper who sells the Cenarian beverage, buy one, and head back to Falcon Watch.\n\nGive it to Viera Sunwhisper and she will tell you to follow her. When she stops and starts drinking it, use the scroll on her and a suprise will happen.",
            date = "2006-12-10T20:05:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472#comments:id=13020",
        },
        {
            id = 5473513,
            score = 194,
            author = "OptikRise",
            text = "I screwed up on this quest today and had to fly back to [zone=3521] twice so I wanted to provide some updated steps:\n\nFly to Firefly Tavern at Cenarion Refuge in [zone=3521] - /way Zangarmarsh 78.67 63.27 Firefly Tavern\nSpeak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18907  and buy one bottle of https://www.wowhead.com/item=29112 - /way Zangarmarsh 78.50 62.95 Innkeeper Coryth Stoktron\nHead back to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17226 and turn in the bottle of https://www.wowhead.com/item=29112 as a quest item for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9483 - in Patch 10.0 they introduced a mechanic that turns your cursor into a quest item, in this case https://www.wowhead.com/item=23693. If you double/triple-click on Viera, you should get the quest dialogue box to pull up. /way Hellfire Peninsula 27.15 62.11 Viera Sunwhisper\nYou'll follow her outside of Falcon Watch and use the scroll on her\nTurn the quest back into https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16793 - /way Hellfire Peninsula 26.38 60.35 Magistrix Carinda",
            date = "2022-11-19T10:59:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472#comments:id=5473513",
        },
        {
            id = 5764964,
            score = 125,
            author = "Desorus",
            text = "For anyone doing this quest, or loremaster in general, after patch 10.0.7 where the mouse cursor turns into the quest item and you can't give her the wine use the following command to solve it:\n\n/console interactQuestItems 0",
            date = "2024-01-14T16:34:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472#comments:id=5764964",
        },
        {
            id = 44970,
            score = 107,
            author = "Zugluk",
            text = "Buy Cenarion Spirits from the innkeeper in the next zone west of the quest giver. Then give the spirits to Viera, and she will move so that you can read the scroll to her.\n\n- Carinda 26,60\n- Viera 27,62\n- Innkeeper Coryth Stockton is located in the Zangarmarsh zone  (Cenarion Refuge 78,62)",
            date = "2007-03-02T07:14:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472#comments:id=44970",
        },
        {
            id = 265707,
            score = 55,
            author = "59431",
            text = "Well hell hath no fury like a woman scorned. Clear evidence here.",
            date = "2008-04-03T11:29:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472#comments:id=265707",
        },
    },
