        {
            id = 5678214,
            score = 2,
            author = "BlastItLands",
            text = "v10.1.7.51187\n\nI had trouble because https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9472 was not letting me click Viera Sunwhisper to accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9483 .\n\nViera only had the blue ? mark, and no visible ! mark. Everytime I clicked on the NPC, I got a message that said: \"Requires Discreet Location\". I tried dropping the quest, and the ? mark went away, but the ! mark never appeared (even with Trivial Quests ticked on the minimap).\n\nFinally I just double clicked (left-click or right-click) on Viera a few times and suddenly the Life's Finer Pleasures quest window opened.\n\nNot sure if this is a bug or intended behavior, but hopefully this will help others.",
            date = "2023-09-06T20:25:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9483#comments:id=5678214",
        },
    },
