        {
            id = 1833192,
            score = 13,
            author = "missmagy",
            text = "just went to do this Q for transmog gloves.\nwhen i read the quest and saw the reward.. i honestly felt bad for this guy, and after loking over the comments i cant believe no one has mentioned this yet but...\n\n\"I swore that one day Blacktalon would pay for that. You bring back proof of that monster's death and I will give you my life's savings. Deal?\"\n\nthe guy gives you like 6 gold.\nnice life's savings.....",
            date = "2013-03-23T10:09:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9490#comments:id=1833192",
        },
        {
            id = 255425,
            score = 8,
            author = "62228",
            text = "For feral druids to get feral charge range, and anyone else who wants to get a bit of range for a second....\n\nThere's a pile of bones just outside the cave to the right, he seems incapable of walking over them.  If you get him on one side, then jump over the bones he'll take the long way around.  This can get you some time to get to charge range.",
            date = "2008-03-18T17:28:48-05:00",
