            text = "This quest became available after completing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10123. I also completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10450 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10086 prior; those may or may not also be prerequisities.\n\nNote that there is a unique version of this quest for blood elves: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9499",
