        {
            id = 83071,
            score = 6,
            author = "Sunlesssky",
            text = "Quest giver is at 19/64. Items able to be looted off of little baloon objects that are to the west of the quest giver. Quest is also repeatable until you reack Friendly. There is also another quest that is good until friendly, http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9744. The quest item drops off the Bog Lords that are in the same area as well as scattered all over Z Marsh.  Also Complete this quest with http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9701.",
