        },
        {
            id = 134086,
            score = 15,
            author = "StubMcBean",
            text = "In the Northeast (in the Dead Mire) they're called Withered Giants - http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18124 - and Withered Bog Lords - http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19402 - and they drop these tendrils about 1 in 5. If you go after these instead of the southwestern Bog Lords, make sure you have this quest - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9782 - and then you can work on it plus the next one in the chain - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9783 - while you are collecting Tendrils.",
