        },
        {
            id = 22796,
            score = 8,
            author = "Finko",
            text = "Bog Lords in the northeast corner of the Zangarmarsh drop these as well.",
            date = "2007-01-22T13:01:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9744#comments:id=22796",
        },
        {
            id = 1628950,
            score = 5,
            author = "Schnoodledorfer",
            text = "Although you can easily level all the way to Friendly just by grinding https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9742 or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9744, as soon as you reach Neutral you should probably at least pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808. Not only do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9809 provide another way to build rep to Friendly, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808 gives XP and counts toward the loremaster achievement. You will miss out on that if you don't pick it up while still neutral.\n\nHaving https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9919 offered to (at Neutral) you can be a signal that it's time to switch gears. Since you will be traveling from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17923 to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17924 anyway, you can complete it easily, but you may not want to. Once you picked up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808, you can go back to killing bog lords and gathering spore sacks until friendly if you prefer. If you turn in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9919 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808 after reaching Friendly, you can add the 750 rep from each of to the next part of the rep grind.\n\nBTW, this quest does not count toward https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1190. AFAIK, none of the repeatable ones do. (Wowhead currently says it does.)",
            date = "2012-02-19T11:20:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9744#comments:id=1628950",
        },
    },
