            text = "Witchdoctors can be found around and in the biggest hut (84 90). Kataru is also in there on the top floor guarded by a witchdoctor....very easy kills as a 63 hunter. cause of the poor numbers of withchdoctors you might want wait for respawn at the big hut....takes about 4 mins te respawn.",
