            score = 8,
            author = "15540",
            text = "Umbra lake is near cenarion refuge.\n\nCoords: 78.66 (is very big lake) and the hydras are at the margins of the lake. In any case you don`t need to enter in water. Try move around the cenarion coast(east one), the nagas coast ...is hard because is imposible to don`t agro.",
            date = "2007-01-26T00:08:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9781#comments:id=24745",
        },
        {
            id = 448959,
            score = 5,
            author = "192631",
            text = "The mire hydras stay on the shore of the lake, and are relatively easy to find and kill. 77,64 are the coordinates for the shore right next to Cenarion Refuge, but anywhere around Umbrafen Lake will have the hydras.",
            date = "2008-11-16T22:54:05-06:00",
