        },
        {
            id = 117325,
            score = 10,
            author = "68583",
            text = "The Quests \"A Warm Welcome\" http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9728 and \"Plants of Zangarmarsh\" http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9802 will be a good idea to get since they are in the same area.\n\nI just soloed her with my rogue lvl 63. Used Adrenaline Rush + Evasion in the beginning and that took away alot of her HP.\nKeep spamming Kidney Shot and Kick to prevent her from casting. Also Mind-Numbering Poison on one sword. Not very difficult and the adds was no problem.\n\nWhen she gets to 1300-1200 HP she attampts to run so be sure your Kidney Shot is ready\n\nCoords 65,40",
            date = "2007-07-08T06:03:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9817#comments:id=117325",
        },
    },
