            text = "You can use the item he provides if you want, but it's far easy to just run along the mountain range extending from the Throne of the Elements to Laughing Skull Ruins. Two passes along here at most will easily get you enough cores. They drop at about a 75% rate.\n\nYou can toss the item after the quest is complete as well.",
