            text = "My experience at 57,53\n\nMake sure you look at the map and head in right next to the Ring of Trials located at 66,53 otherwise youll be running around the canyon looking for a way to get in. The mobs are easy (agressive) the only other mobs around are some lvl 64 Windroc birds who are (passive). The spawn rate wasn't extremely fast for the Enraged Crushers, I killed about 9 and waited around for the others to spawn. There are a few fel iron deposits down here as well.\n\nMote of earth 20%\nEnraged Cruser Core 90%\nOshu'gun Crystal Powder Sample 20%",
