            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9839#comments:id=21022",
        },
        {
            id = 91542,
            score = 38,
            author = "10315",
            text = "A note on the item if your heavy into +spell damage: If you're wondering whether to choose the cloth wrist or the trinket, take the trinket as there won't be another quest after this that rewards an equip +spell damage trinket (plenty from isntance/raid loots, but do you want to wait that long after reaching 70?), even though there will be ~3 more different types of +spell damage cloth bracers before you leave Nagrand (~lvl67). I made the oversight of choosing the wrists due to the reason I started my mage post-BC and had *very* bad gear, without checking wowhead first =S. Plenty of my post-70 and kara raiding friends still occasionally use this trinket unless they had better",
            date = "2007-05-27T05:48:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9839#comments:id=91542",
        },
