            text = "I gues that with the new 2.2.3 patch drop rate is increased, couse I killed 10 of them and they all droped the Q item. Drop rate was 100% for me, dunno, maybe I was just lucky :D Pretty easy Q too, couse i found both the Q mobs and Count Ungula near to Zabra'jin where Q giver is.",
