            text = "Confirming a 100% drop rate as of 8/7/2011.  Strange for WoW in general but especially for Zangarmarsh quests. I won't complain though.  And around the above coords is still a good place to grind 'em.  One thing, just make sure you aren't killing sporebats (unless you want to), they look quite similar.",
            date = "2011-08-07T14:05:20-05:00",
