            author = "6934",
            text = "These guys are clumped up near the entrance to coilfang reservoir, at the bottom of the lake.  Easy kills, but I suggest having some sort of underwater breathing buff.\n\nYour water breathing potion from Maktu's Revenge works great if you still have charges left. http://www.wowhead.com/?item=25539",
