            text = "This quest is great if you put off doing the Thick Hydra Scales (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9774). I got 6/8 of them by the time I had 10/10 hydras slain.",
            date = "2007-04-05T19:05:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9845#comments:id=62716",
