            text = "Tusker is on the bluff to the Northeast of Oshu'gun(the bluff is actually visable on your map).  Was able to trio this with three level 66's, though it is likely duoable with two level 68's as the quest log says.  She was not snarable or rootable.",
            date = "2006-12-15T00:58:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9852#comments:id=15723",
        },
        {
