            score = 28,
            author = "39880",
            text = "Gutripper is a black colored 67 elite bird/owl that roams in a pattern just east of Warmaul Hill. If you don't find him at first Gutripper roams in a repeatable pattern. Just outside of Forge Camp Hate: heading northeast he will roam visiting all the clefthoof corpses, heading in a northerly direction on the western side of the road leading to Zangarmarsh. He will roam almost to the border of Zangarmarsh before crossing the road and heading east towards more clefthoof corpses. At this point he will track south a little bit before taking off to the air where he will track again towards Forge Camp: Hate and begin his pattern again. It takes roughly 5 minutes to complete his roaming pattern.\n\nGutripper is immune to Fear and will present a problem to hunters attempting to kite him because he flys very fast.",
            date = "2007-04-04T21:03:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9856#comments:id=62228",
        },
        {
            id = 34814,
            score = 16,
            author = "18685",
            text = "The respawn time of Gutripper is around 5 minutes, I guess that's the same for the other two elites from the Mastery-quests.",
            date = "2007-02-12T17:12:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9856#comments:id=34814",
        },
        {
            id = 63062,
            score = 12,
            author = "bebbe",
            text = "Completing Talbuk mastery, Windroc mastery and Clefthoof mastery will unlock the quest The Ultimate Bloodsport (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9852).",
            date = "2007-04-06T19:45:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9856#comments:id=63062",
        },
        {
