            text = "This quest is required for the Throne of the Elements subsection of the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1273 Achievement.\n\nTo get this quest, you have to pick up a https://www.wowhead.com/item=24504\n\nThey are predominately dropped from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17158, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17159 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17160 in Nagrand.\n\nTake this to Elementalist Morgh at the Throne of the Elements and he will give you the follow up quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9862",
