            text = "There are actually quest rewards for this:\nGreenkeeper's Pantaloons\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25574\n\nSmuggler's Mitts\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25576\n\nThunderbringer's Guard\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25575",
