        {
            id = 810683,
            score = 22,
            author = "294737",
            text = "Saurfang the Younger's \"greater purpose\" that he refers to, takes place in the WoTLK expansion. He's the orc who charges in and gets his soul stolen by Frostmourne during the Wrathgate cinematic. During the Yogg Saron encounter, in one of the possible brain phase visions you see Saurfang Jr. salute the Lich King when he tells Bolvar \"I will break you as I broke him\". It's been proposed that they will both be bosses in 3.3, the Icecrown Citadel update. Small hint of this after the cinematic. What Alexstrasza is saying, when speaking in dragon as you approach, is \"They must not yet discover the fate of the young paladin\", to which her consort replies \"They will not\".",
