        },
        {
            id = 30001,
            score = 19,
            author = "19634",
            text = "Just as a note, this guy attacks alliance (as well as anything else that would be red to you). During my trip he attacked a rogue, who vanished, and a paladin that I ended up having to kill. If you're on a pvp server you may want to make sure there isnt a large group of alliance on the road out or else you'll be up for a hefty amount of pvp.\n\nOtherwise, a straight forward quest. Solo'ed as a 69 druid in bear form the entire time. Just be ready for a fight as soon as you accept the quest.",
            date = "2007-02-03T11:35:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9868#comments:id=30001",
        },
        {
            id = 1951380,
            score = 17,
            author = "Redead",
            text = "You cannot start this quest until you are at least neutral with the Mag'har.\n\nTo reach neutral complete The Impotent Leader (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9888). Also, the hostile mobs around the captive must be dead or the quest will not be available.",
            date = "2014-03-16T00:44:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9868#comments:id=1951380",
        },
        {
            id = 559394,
            score = 15,
            author = "Haelstrom",
            text = "Easily the best Escort mission I have ever taken.\n\nNormally in escort missions, if you see a fork in the road and one route's relatively clear while the other's filled with monsters, the escort decides \".. DEM 'DERE MONSTERS DA BEST WAY EVER!\" Not this guy.\n\nHell, he even heals you - I was down to 1K HP and he full-healed my ass right back up to 7k. And he does decent damage, too; easily solo'd as a 66 Assassination Rogue.",
            date = "2009-01-12T11:53:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9868#comments:id=559394",
        },
    },
