        {
            id = 2335278,
            score = 27,
            author = "frakbt",
            text = "A couple of comments about Murkblood Invaders who walk \"the path\", as though there's only one path in Nagrand, lol.  They aren't referring to any of the paths inside Sunspring Post.\n\nThere are at least two packs of these mobs: one pats the path coming in from western Zangarmarsh to Garadar; a second pack pats back and forth past Aeris Landing.\n\nThe plans appear to be a 100% drop.",
            date = "2016-05-29T09:57:22-05:00",
