            date = "2010-03-03T07:22:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9875#comments:id=989511",
        },
        {
            id = 3245281,
            score = 5,
            author = "StoneLegion",
            text = "If you are like me who just wants to do every quest possible for fun / grind... This sadly is one the worst. Best suggest is to try not getting ANY  Cenarion Expedition Rep and first thing to do in the Outlands is buy the plant parts from the AH and hand them in ASAP as it's the only way to get this item via the bag rewards...\n\nI'm sadly can't hand them in now and will never be able to do this quest.",
            date = "2020-11-03T22:49:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9875#comments:id=3245281",
        },
        {
            id = 78223,
            score = 4,
            author = "30739",
            text = "No pre-reqs, I have a lvl 61 NE alt that I gave enough plant parts to to go from 0 into neutral to honored. She hadn't done anything in Zangarmarsh, not even the Cenarion Outpost quests in Hellfire.  I got 4 of the Uncatalogued plant parts, which puts the drop rate at like 1 in 11 turnins for me, since I turned in just over 450 unidentified plant parts. So they seem to be pretty rare.",
            date = "2007-05-05T14:49:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9875#comments:id=78223",
        },
    },
