        },
        {
            id = 134424,
            score = 5,
            author = "CharlzO",
            text = "The NPC in Nagrand, is named Gezhe , of The Consortium faction. He stands at 31, 57 for those with coords, or just inside the little arch doorway, on the right, in the Aeris Landing camp, which is located due South of Sunspring Post, on the other side of the lake along the road.",
            date = "2007-08-08T14:08:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9885#comments:id=134424",
        },
        {
            id = 1687453,
            score = 5,
            author = "belhaven",
            text = "As of the Cataclysm expansion, the green-level gems appear to be more salable since they are useful for leveling (and the https://www.wowhead.com/item=23112 are especially valuable since they are needed by tailors).\n\nThe lower level rep rewards (Friendly & Honored) are therefore more profitable than the higher level ones since they have a better percentage of giving you green-level gems; the blue-level gems are essentially vendor trash on most servers.",
            date = "2012-07-12T19:55:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9885#comments:id=1687453",
        },
        {
            id = 35215,
            score = 3,
            author = "haus",
            text = "I got the first envelope of gems back a few days after the release of the expansion.  I have heard this is repeatable once a month for another gem reward pouch.  Is that true?  Is it the same NPC in Nagrand? Or do you have to find one in Stormspire?",
            date = "2007-02-13T11:02:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9885#comments:id=35215",
        },
    },
