            text = "The \"monthly\" rewards is currently bugged, confirmed by Blizzard. It's on their list to be fixed in a future patch. At this time there has been no word if there will be \"back-pay\" or any other details on the timing.\n\nUpdate: In patch 2.1 http://forums.worldofwarcraft.com/thread.html?topicId=94203802&sid=1 characters with reputation of Honored or higher can go to Gezhe in Nagrand to pickup their monthly payment.",
