            author = "916405",
            text = "This quest does not show up on your mini-map because of the fact that the repeatable quest over-rides the non-repeatable one (repeatable as in you can continually hand it in, not just one a month). The quest is obtained from Gezhe in Aeris Landing. I hope this helps! (I was stuck at 74/75 quests for Nagrand Slam and this quest did put me over and I got the achievement) Happy Hunting!",
