    [9892] = {
        {
            id = 38423,
            score = 68,
            author = "21247",
            text = "This gives rep all the way to exalted.",
            date = "2007-02-18T23:45:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9892#comments:id=38423",
        },
        {
            id = 903856,
            score = 27,
            author = "491037",
            text = "I've been grinding outlands rep as an 80 spreist and here's what I've found\n\nIn 1 hour I can grind 160 Zaxxis Insignia and about 10 prison keys.\nThat works out to roughly 4k Rep from insignia and 2.5k from keys (assuming each gives 250 which they don't always)  -  so call it 6K per hour from the area just south of Area 52  (i'm ignoring the random 500 rep you can get from some prisoners)\n\nif I grind warbeads from Laughing skull ruins and the cave just north of Halaa then in 1 hour I can grind about 70 beads from 200 ogre kills.\nRemember that beads are worth 500 Maghar Rep or 250 Consortium so this hour would get 2K from kills and 3.5k from beads on Maghar/1.75k on Consortium\n\nInsignia = 6k/hr\nMaghar beads = 5.5k/hr\nConsortium beads = 3.75k/hr    (2k mag 1.75k consort)\n\nBottom line? So if you are grinding BOTH reputations then save the beads for Maghar don't hand them in for Consortium and grind insignia in Netherstorm, it'll save you about 1/3 of your time.\nIf you're grinding Maghar then don't bother with insignia (duh), if you're grinding Consortium then go straight to Netherstorm\n\nDrKazza",
            date = "2009-11-30T19:25:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9892#comments:id=903856",
        },
        {
            id = 43940,
            score = 11,
            author = "27334",
            text = "Quest Rep: 275 (Human Racial)\n\nDoing this quest will also indirectly net you reputation with Kurenai +10, +11 (if you're Human). Rach Orge kill gives you reputation with Kurenai.\n\nI'm currently getting through Revered with Kurenai just by grinding these orges for their warbeads which I'll turn into for The Consortium for their reputation. I think that's a good deal... I didn't notice that I was getting reputation with Kurenai until I turned Revered with them during an Orge grinding session. When you glow green, and a noise pops up - it tends to wake you up and take notice. :)\n\nIf you're going for Exalted with The Consortium, You might as well grind these Orges because you'll be killing two reputation grinds at one time.\n\nThere's a lot of places you can farm for these beads as well, which means if you run into a lot of people - just move on to a less populated place and grind there: http://www.wowhead.com/?item=25433.",
            date = "2007-02-28T11:34:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9892#comments:id=43940",
        },
        {
            id = 879063,
            score = 7,
            author = "error10",
            text = "The Obsidian Warbeads (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=25433) can be looted, and this quest can be completed, while in a raid group.",
            date = "2009-10-30T21:11:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9892#comments:id=879063",
        },
        {
            id = 855318,
            score = 5,
            author = "jerodast",
            text = "Does not count towards Nagrand Slam (http://www.wowhead.com/?achievement=1192).",
            date = "2009-09-29T15:27:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9892#comments:id=855318",
        },
    },
