            author = "43216",
            text = "Simple quest, Sporewing is a lvl 62, non-elite, easily soloable.\n\nAs for rewards, picking the stack of \"Scroll of Strength V\" (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=27503) would be your best option from a gold-making perspective.\n\nThe scrolls are relatively hard to come by and sell very nicely in the AH since Blacksmiths need two of these scrolls to make Ragesteel Shoulders: (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=33173)",
