        {
            id = 225821,
            score = 5,
            author = "64177",
            text = "All the scrolls rewarded by this quest are of limited availability. They are all purchasable from the first two vendors in limited supply with strength, stamina, agility and spirit sold by the third, also in limited supply.:\n\nField Repair Bot 110G (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=24780)\nProfessor Thaddeus Paleo (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=14847)\nSahaak (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23363)\n\nYou can only buy from Sahaak vendor when doing the quest A Shabby Disguise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11029)\n\nScrolls stack with elixirs of the same stat bonus but not single stat player buffs. In other words scrolls of stamina, intellect and spirit wont stack with PW:F, Divine Spirit or Arcane intellect and are of little use in a raid.\n\nScrolls of agility and strength *do* stack with shaman totems buffing that stat and are highly sought after. I suggest choosing these either for personal use when raiding at level 70 or to sell on the AH. I choose the agility scrolls and sold them for 10g on Defias Brotherhood - EU\n\nThe scrolls of protection stack with elixirs and player buffs but don't tend to be so popular.",
