            score = 42,
            author = "Khabal",
            text = "When you attack Lump, he says, \"In Nagrand, food hunt ogre!\", which is most definitely in reference to Yakov Smirnoff's \"Russian Reversal\" which he made very popular in the mid-1980's.\n\nhttp://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_Soviet_Russia\n\nI just thought it was funny. :)",
            date = "2007-03-24T10:13:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918#comments:id=56308",
        },
        {
            id = 634240,
            score = 40,
            author = "260480",
            text = "The battle plans were written up by an ogre lieutenant. His name is either Dump or Lump.\n\nIt could also be Billy.\n\n L\nO\nL",
            date = "2009-03-07T09:39:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918#comments:id=634240",
        },
        {
            id = 25532,
            score = 29,
            author = "13265",
            text = "Lump is asleep at 62,71, and will wake up and aggro when you come near. He has about 10k hp, and you will need to beat him down to around 30% before he will give up and turn green. You then need to talk to him to get the quest credit.",
            date = "2007-01-27T06:20:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918#comments:id=25532",
        },
        {
            id = 128875,
            score = 24,
            author = "Jaegermeister2k",
            text = "If he disappears after you talk to him and he was green when you met him it means someone did the quest before you. He will stay there after the quest was done and disappear after a while. In order for you to do the quest. He has to respawn. Which after he does he will be asleep and not sitting.\n\nAnd yeah he showed as 10195HP to me as well. I believe the way the mods work is they don't actually know the HP of a mob, but calculate it on the fly as they see the amount of damage you're doing and the amount of health they're losing. When you first attack a mob if you have never attacked that particular kind of mob, at that particulat lvl they will always show low hp, and work their way up to the actual HP as the mod does its calculating.",
            date = "2007-07-29T20:50:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918#comments:id=128875",
        },
    },
