            text = "you can easily get to Neutral, by gathering 30 spore sacs, and turning in the repeatable quest to this guy.\nYou need 10 spores for each quest, and it gives 750rep!\n\nthe place is flooded in spores, so you can gather ~100 in less than 30mins",
