        {
            id = 1629021,
            score = 1,
            author = "Schnoodledorfer",
            text = "This quest gives 750 rep. (Wowhead currently says 250.) You might want to pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17924 before turning this one in to him. The 750 rep from this one might be enough to make you Friendly. If that happens, you won't be able to pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9808 anymore, so you would loose out on the chance to earn XP with it and for it to count toward https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1190. Becoming friendly once you have it doesn't prevent you from turning it in, though.",
            date = "2012-02-19T13:18:12-06:00",
