        {
            id = 609881,
            score = 14,
            author = "323344",
            text = "From a lore point of view, its quite interesting to see the end result of the efforts (same quest line) between the Alliance here and the Horde version, it is good storytelling of the poor leadership on the side of the Horde in Nagrand.  Note the difference in the Completion text.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9934",
            date = "2009-02-15T03:32:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9933#comments:id=609881",
        },
        {
            id = 2295617,
            score = 13,
            author = "parrydox",
            text = "I've done this on multiple higher level characters to obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=25608 (Horde) or https://www.wowhead.com/item=25603 (Alliance) for xmog. I was surprised by the lack of information out there on how to start and complete this quest chain, so I put together my strategy for others to use.\n\nFor Horde:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9888\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9889: I actually really enjoyed the challenge of this quest as a higher level character. We're always killing things but how often are you told NOT to kill something? To complete this quest at level 100 you must do one of the falling:  (a.) The easiest way is to recruit a lower level character to help you beat down https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18262 without killing him. You can usually find someone running around the area. Offer to help them kill Ogres if they will help you NOT kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18262 and it will be a win-win.  (b.) Or acquire https://www.wowhead.com/item=18588, which can be crafted by engineers, but does not require engineering to use. Purchase one from the AH or you can get 5 as a reward from the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10629 from the chain beginning with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10236 in Hellfire Peninsula (don't worry, it's short and easy and there are no other prerequisites other than level). Remove all of your armor so there is nothing to proc or add damage. Run up to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18262, toss an https://www.wowhead.com/item=18588 at him which should leave a sliver of health, and you're done!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9890\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9891\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9906\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9907\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10107\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9928 +++ https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9927\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9931 +++ https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9932\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9934\n\nFor Alliance:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9917\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918: I actually really enjoyed the challenge of this quest as a higher level character. We're always killing things but how often are you told NOT to kill something? To complete this quest at level 100 you must do one of the falling:  (a.) The easiest way is to recruit a lower level character to help you beat down https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18351 without killing him. You can usually find someone running around the area. Offer to help them kill Ogres if they will help you NOT kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18351 and it will be a win-win.  (b.) Or acquire https://www.wowhead.com/item=18588, which can be crafted by engineers, but does not require engineering to use. Purchase one from the AH or you can get 5 as a reward from the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10629 from the chain beginning with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10236 in Hellfire Peninsula (don't worry, it's short and easy and there are no other prerequisites other than level). Remove all of your armor so there is nothing to proc or add damage. Run up to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18351, toss an https://www.wowhead.com/item=18588 at him which should leave a sliver of health, and you're done!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9920\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9921\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9922\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10108\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9928 +++ https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9927\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9931 +++ https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9932\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9933",
            date = "2016-01-06T19:03:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9933#comments:id=2295617",
        },
        {
            id = 933179,
            score = 6,
            author = "rogueyay",
            text = "Note this quest is called Message to Telaar and not \"A\" message to Telaar, which just gives exp, no items.",
            date = "2009-12-31T01:32:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9933#comments:id=933179",
        },
    },
