            text = "This quest is soloable by higher levels. You can either stealth in to Corki or work your way in. Next to Corki is Warmaul Chef Bufferlo (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18440#00Rzc), a level 66 elite who isn't too difficult.\n\nThe next step of this quest (Cho'war the Pillager) involves killing an elite who is significantly more difficult.",
