            author = "Taraezor",
            text = "Follow this quest chain right through to the end. Often overlooked, but a little Cenarion Expedition reputation to be had, including the very last quest in the chain. At this stage those grinding the reputation are generally more focused on moving on to DEHTA in the Borean Tundra. This is easy rep for very few kills. No need to fly all the way to Coilfang where you'd struggle to solo a heroic at this level and some class would struggle on normals.",
