            author = "Kman4225",
            text = "Originally posted by dJe781\n\nPart of the Ring of Blood event :\n\n1. Brokentoe (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18398)\n\n2. Murkblood Twin (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18399)\n\n3. Rokdar the Sundered Lord (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18400)\n\n4. Skra'gath (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18401)\n\n5. Warmaul Champion (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18402)\n\n6. Mogor  (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18069)\n\nTo clarify the numbers correspond to the quest number in the quest chain.",
            date = "2010-12-20T01:21:19-06:00",
