        },
        {
            id = 23155,
            score = 27,
            author = "12816",
            text = "Pre-req for this quest http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10001\n\nI actually completed this quest without attacking him at all. When I arrived at Sal'salabim, 2 alliance were already killing him. When they got him down to low health, he went back to his spot with a quest complete message over his head. I guess you just have to be in the area when he gets 'subdued'",
            date = "2007-01-23T08:33:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=23155",
        },
        {
            id = 670307,
            score = 25,
            author = "124064",
            text = "He is located at 77,35 (http://www.wowhead.com/?maps=3703:770353) in Shattrath at the World's End Tavern in the Lower City. Soloed this quest as a 68 Elemental Shaman. First laid down a Stoneclaw Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=25525) to avoid grabbing aggro. Not necessary as you won't die from one hit, but might as well. Then drop a Fire Elemental Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=2894), talk to him to get it started, toss a few Lightning Bolt (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=25449)'s when you get a chance and heal. Easy.",
            date = "2009-04-08T21:27:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=670307",
        },
        {
            id = 54046,
            score = 17,
