            author = "6934",
            text = "Back to Bonechewer ruins for this one.  The Backbreakers and Devestaters are littered throughout the center of the camp, so you'll have to fight your way through the peons to get to em.  Easy kills, non elites.\n\nSuggestion:  Pair this quest up with The Firewing Liaison (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10003 ). Both quest objectives are located in this general area.",
