            text = "These 3 mobs are much, much easier than the guy that they owe money to (that you fought in the previous quest). Easily soloable.",
            date = "2007-07-07T23:43:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10009#comments:id=117177",
        },
    },
