        {
            id = 1989392,
            score = 28,
            author = "warlock8851",
            text = "I found that when you mouse over the real ones, it reads:\n\nDraenei Vessel\nVessels of Power\n - Draenei Vessels 0/8\n\nWhile when you mouseover a fake one, it only reads:\n\nDraenei Vessel\n\nThis worked for me and helped me finish the quest much faster.",
            date = "2014-08-07T14:37:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10028#comments:id=1989392",
        },
        {
            id = 67144,
            score = 15,
            author = "26820",
            text = "You might want to do the following quest at the same time:\n\n[64] Investivate Tuurem (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9990)",
            date = "2007-04-14T13:37:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10028#comments:id=67144",
        },
        {
            id = 2488311,
            score = 15,
            author = "Aldavor",
            text = "Completely bugged as of today.\n\nAs stated before, the real ones (when hovered over) say \"Draenei Vessel - Vessels of Power - Draenei Vessel */8\" - the fake ones only say \"Draenei Vessel\".\n\nThe problem is, that the fakes don't respawn or disappear when clicked - they only go through an opening motion or it's simply a system message. Any real ones respawn as fakes, so I managed to get 4 before the entire area was filled with fakes, and no real ones - AT ALL.",
            date = "2017-04-18T09:19:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10028#comments:id=2488311",
        },
    },
    [10030] = {
        {
            id = 25886,
            score = 40,
            author = "16456",
            text = "This quest is not available until you complete \"The Tomb of Lights\" from High Priest Orglum.  Thats a really weird prereq, probably not intended, but you must complete it first.",
            date = "2007-01-27T17:46:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030#comments:id=25886",
        },
        {
            id = 180907,
            score = 40,
            author = "Amanda",
            text = "To turn in the quest:\n\n1. Enter the Ring of Observance (The middle segment of Auchindoun.) There are a number of entrances leading down.\n\n2. Head for the entrance around 37.65.\n\n3. Go west into the big room there.\n\n4. You will find Ramdor the Mad on top of a large pile of bones. (35.66)",
            date = "2007-11-08T06:29:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030#comments:id=180907",
        },
        {
            id = 11960,
            score = 29,
            author = "6934",
            text = "These are spread out all over the bone wastes.  They're small piles of bones that glow purplish-blue.  Save some time and do this quest while doing one of the other quests that takes you into this area.",
            date = "2006-12-09T02:04:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030#comments:id=11960",
        },
        {
            id = 25278,
            score = 22,
            author = "15286",
            text = "The entrance is more like 35, 58",
            date = "2007-01-26T18:25:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030#comments:id=25278",
        },
        {
            id = 336901,
            score = 13,
            author = "Jaunter",
            text = "There are four separate entrances to the Ring of Observance from the Bone Wastes.  They are on the NW at (35.2,58.8), the NE at (44.2,58.8), the SE at (44.2,72.5), and the SW at (35.2,72.5).  Any of them will get you into the Ring.  Use some caution at the SW entrance - it is surrounded by a lot of enemy NPC's.  All the entrances have two marker braziers framing them.  They all lead down into an underground hallway that in turn leads down to the Ring of Observance proper.  After getting there, just go to the west side of the Ring and look for two purple braziers that mark an entrance (to the Auchenai Crypts instance).  After passing in between them, you'll see Ramdor ahead a bit to your left standing on a pile of bones.",
            date = "2008-07-26T17:02:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030#comments:id=336901",
        },
    },
    [10031] = {
        {
            id = 24707,
            score = 17,
            author = "14235",
            text = "The area just south of Auchindoun seems to have a lot of spirits/skeletons. Maybe because ppl dont go there so often, u will find plenty of them in there. Around 38.79.",
            date = "2007-01-25T22:16:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10031#comments:id=24707",
        },
        {
            id = 11972,
            score = 16,
            author = "6934",
            text = "Lost Spirits and Broken Skeletons wander nearly every inch of the Bone Wastes.. if you aren't seeing any, just move on and you're garaunteed to hit some.",
            date = "2006-12-09T02:58:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10031#comments:id=11972",
        },
        {
            id = 13343,
            score = 11,
            author = "9387",
            text = "The mobs in the area like to swarm you, so if you see more than 3 in a particular area, don't stand there killing them or you can get overwhelmed. The easiest way to do this is to pull them to the walls of Auchindoun where there are no other mobs.",
            date = "2006-12-11T09:42:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10031#comments:id=13343",
        },
        {
            id = 1789310,
            score = 10,
            author = "976160",
            text = "I wanted one of the quest rewards for transmog, and apparently I pretty much skipped this area while leveling. Here's the full line of quests I had to do to get this quest to become available:\n\nThe Eyes of Skettis ( http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10847) (From Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City area of Shattrath)\nMissing Friends ( http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10852) (From Ethan at the Refugee Caravan)\nVengeful Souls ( http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10842) (From High Priest Orglum at the Caravan)\nTomb of Lights (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10840) (From High Priest Orglum at the Caravan)\nRecover the Bones (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10030) (From Soolaveen at the Caravan - turn in to Ramdor the Mad, where you then pickup this quest)",
            date = "2012-12-29T21:21:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10031#comments:id=1789310",
        },
        {
            id = 28954,
            score = 8,
            author = "Mandalore",
            text = "48, 74 has a large concentration of both skellies and spirits.",
            date = "2007-02-01T13:28:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10031#comments:id=28954",
        },
    },
