            text = "Her response when you turn in the quest is pretty funny, and kind of capitalizes on the fact that some quest givers *do* just believe that you killed a bunch of mobs.\n\n\"Yeah, I'm sure that you killed all of those bonelashers.  It's obvious since the captain asked for you to turn in proof on that wanted poster.\n\n\"\n\nMade me laugh the first time I saw this. xD",
