            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rN_Ro3arpBU\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10033\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10033, from the https://www.wowhead.com/object=182587 at coords 57.6, 54.7 (Allerian Stronghold).\n•\009Travel west, to the Bone Wastes, and kill 20 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18470 mobs (located in the areas to the northeast and east of Auchindoun).\n•\009Travel back to Allerian Stronghold to coords 58.0, 53.4.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18704.",
            date = "2016-01-16T10:36:48-06:00",
