        {
            id = 21061,
            score = 40,
            author = "1966",
            text = "The laborer has a short patrol path near the entrance to the 'base' from the ramp closest to Private Weeks. The initiate is near the small pond of water; it'll look like it's casting a spell. The advisor is in the middle of the trashed-up building.\n\nBe careful when entering the building because there's only one path to the middle of it, and if a hunter is inside, make sure you turn around quickly before it catches you.",
