            text = "I would definitely try to collect the 160 powder samples needed to get the Halaani Bag (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=27680).  It's much cheaper than any other 18 slot bag you will find.  It's going to take you a while to get all that collected, but worth it in the end, I think.  Other than that item, I don't see much use in the Halaa stuff for PvE. Even for PvP, you'll get better gear from Battlegrounds.",
