            text = "The guy is right at the bottom of the mine, easy to find (there is only one way to go) He is a level 62 Non-Elite. If your not careful you will pull him and a level 60 mob, like I did.\n\nEasy enough at level 61 solo",
            date = "2006-12-19T05:32:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10099#comments:id=17221",
        },
        {
