        },
        {
            id = 2285869,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aKU0VImA7Pc\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10099\n•\009Accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10099 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16837 at coords 52, 62.4 (West of Honor Hold by Mine Shaft).\n•\009Enter the mine shaft, and follow it around to the bottom to the coords 56, 61.6.\n•\009Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18974 (he has a respawn time of several minutes, so if he isn't there, just wait).\n•\009Travel back up the mine shaft, and turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16837 located at coords 52, 62.4.",
