            date = "2007-01-22T01:45:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10107#comments:id=22636",
        },
        {
            id = 1928629,
            score = 8,
            author = "dakota3",
            text = "If you're working on the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1192 achievement and can't find this quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9888 to begin the series, try this, to pick up the quest line again.\n\nBecause I didn't read the quests, I missed the fact that this quest chain takes you out of Nagrand to Terokkar Forest and then back to Nagrand again.\n\nYou will find the NPC you need, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18273 to progress this quest chain in Terokkar Forest at location 19.8, 60.8 (Tom Tom: /way Terokkar Forest 19.77, 60.85).\nIf you don't have a co-ordinate finder, he's on the far western side of the Terokkar Forest map directly above the first 'o' in Bleeding Hollow Ruins at the base of the hills and west of the 'y' shaped road intersection.\n\nSpeak to him and you can pick up the next quest in the chain https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9889 and continue.\n\nGood luck",
            date = "2013-12-23T16:48:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10107#comments:id=1928629",
        },
        {
            id = 26998,
            score = 6,
            author = "17675",
            text = "Its the guy with a (battleground) flag on his back. you've probably seen him before while killing ogres.  he leads to reputation quests .",
            date = "2007-01-29T09:02:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10107#comments:id=26998",
        },
        {
            id = 427921,
            score = 3,
            author = "Arkhan",
            text = "This quest is bugged in that if you listen to the tale of the Blademaster, accept the two quests he gives, then before you complete them cancel from your quest log, you can never get them again.  Talking to Lantresor, you're flagged as having already listened to the tale, so he wont talk to you again, and you can't get the quests until... that's right, you hear the tale.\n\nTicket raised, will see what the outcome is.\n\nI advise either completing the follow ons immediately or not accepting them.",
            date = "2008-11-01T21:36:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10107#comments:id=427921",
        },
    },
