        {
            id = 74671,
            score = 10,
            author = "Forolden",
            text = "23,25 was my kill zone.\nOh, the Daggerfen Muckdwellers put a paralytic poison on you, When they hit abour 40% health... It has a 30 second countdown until it \"hits\". kind of a pain when you've killed them and you start drinking :-) (it interrupts it). Anyways, that's my only advice. Straight forward otherwise.",
            date = "2007-04-29T00:05:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10115#comments:id=74671",
        },
        {
            id = 189345,
