            text = "You have to loot his totem, that's the quest objective, not only kill him.",
            date = "2007-05-05T04:31:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10116#comments:id=78028",
        },
        {
            id = 25982,
            score = 3,
            author = "16877",
            text = "Easily soloed by 63 Rogue.\n\nSap one, take out the Chief and his other guard.  When the Chief disappears, get your hits in on his unsapped bodyguard, and then when the Chief comes back, pound him and repeat.\n\nEvasion would be good..  I didnt have my vanish, but you could take them that way too.  Sap one, take the other one out, vanish, sap again if needed, take out another, and then have at it.",
            date = "2007-01-27T20:50:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10116#comments:id=25982",
        },
    },
