            score = 3,
            author = "8714",
            text = "Very hard quest for warriors, the Muckdwellers deal major damage with their paralysis and run away right as you get paralyzed, aggroing more guys.  The assassins are easy to kill, but often times you become paralyzed by the muckdweller debuff during a fight with an assassin.  Tedious, but do-able.  Pull with a ranged weapon and you'll be okay, so as to ensure they dont flee into stealthers.",
