            text = "Sergeant Shatterskull (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19256) is wrong!\n\n200 paces = 400 steps.\n\nWalking from his position directly to east resulted in exactly 150 paces and Question mark of Forward Commander To'arch (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19273) was right to south from me but... on hill.\n\nAnd who said theorycrafting is not fun? ;)",
