    [10136] = {
        {
            id = 21313,
            score = 206,
            author = "apparentbliss",
            text = "Prereq chain:\n\nFelspark Ravine\nForward Base: Reaver's Fall\nDisrupt Their Reinforcements\nMission: Gateways Murketh and Shaadraz\nMission: The Abyssal Shelf\nReturn to Thrallmar\nForge Camp: Mageddon\nCannons of Rage\nDoorway to the Abyss\nCruel's Intentions",
            date = "2007-01-18T10:30:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10136#comments:id=21313",
        },
        {
            id = 21633,
            score = 24,
            author = "Winco",
            text = "Starts with this quest: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10390",
            date = "2007-01-19T15:52:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10136#comments:id=21633",
        },
        {
            id = 21976,
            score = 24,
            author = "299",
            text = "These are all *major* upgrades to the rewards from the Blackrock Spire trinket quests: For the Horde! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=4974) and General Drakkisath's Demise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=5102). The predecessor for each corresponding trinket is quite obvious.\n\nAt first you might think that they're worse because there's a loss of 2 crit rating on each piece, but the Use effect on each is *well* worth losing a simple 2 spell/melee crit rating. These will be replaced later in life, closer to 70, with better trinkets, because the ratings will not go as far at 70 as they do at 60 due to the scaling system. Also the quest to obtain them is very easy, and doable with 3 (or 2 very well-coordinated friends) unlike the chain for the LBRS/UBRS trinkets.\n\nNOTE: It should also be noted that each of these trinkets shares a cooldown with all the BWL PVP trinkets as well as the Zandalarian trinkets from Zul'gurub.",
            date = "2007-01-20T08:29:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10136#comments:id=21976",
        },
        {
            id = 318027,
            score = 15,
            author = "CaptainColon",
            text = "If you're even just TOYING the idea of switching to a tank spec at 70, take the tanking trinket.  Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar has a quest that gives you a dps trinket with almost identical bonuses as the ones you can get here (I can't remember the name, but I'm pretty sure it's in Terokkar and if I remember correctly it's much easier than this one as well).  The tank trinket will give you a real nice boost to defense (not to mention the use effect) and good tanking trinkets are harder to come by in my experience.  The DPS trinket helped out a lot on the way to 70 but I really wish I'd taken the defense trinket now.\n\nCombine that trinket with Dabiri's Enigma from the Dimensius chain in Netherstorm and you're almost 1/5th of the way to the defense rating you'll need for 490 defese.",
            date = "2008-07-02T08:20:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10136#comments:id=318027",
        },
        {
            id = 21952,
            score = 14,
            author = "Xeenon",
            text = "The trinkets have a cooldown period of 1.5 minutes, in essence this means that you can use them every instance pull. A great addition to an itemset for the adventurous.",
            date = "2007-01-20T06:32:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10136#comments:id=21952",
        },
    },
