            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FEZv_vR6zUQ\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10160\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10160, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16819, at coords 56.6, 66.6 (Upper level of the Honor Hold Barracks).\n•\009Go downstairs, exiting the barracks, and travel northwest toward a tower at coords 51, 60.2.\n•\009Go inside the tower and turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16820.",
