            text = "On this quest, its best to aim at the Overlords or Cannons to get it done fast, the peons are always in the way and are easy to hit...",
            date = "2007-01-21T22:48:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10162#comments:id=22594",
        },
        {
            id = 1733268,
            score = 24,
            author = "WingnutNinja",
            text = "This quest appears to have been updated - somewhat badly - for 5.0. It now attempts to send you home once you've hit your quota. However, it might bug out and send you home before you're done - it took me three tries to actually finish the quest. The first time out, I tossed one bomb and immediately got sent back. It's inconsistent, though, so just keep trying and you should get it eventually.",
            date = "2012-10-06T10:30:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10162#comments:id=1733268",
        },
        {
