        {
            id = 1588148,
            score = 15,
            author = "Clousy",
            text = "(reposting this here, in case people don't think to go directly to the NPC's page ('http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18933/isfar'))\n\nIt seems that with 4.3, they moved this NPC to inside the actual Sethekk Halls instance. The question mark will still show where he used to be (the room with the fire - outside the instance portal) but he won't be there. Confused me for a little, until I tried zoning in on a whim. Watch out for the 67 elites that patrol pretty close to the NPC, if you're doing this at-level.\n\nAt 67, I was able to get to him without aggroing them. He gives the same quests as usual.",
            date = "2011-12-03T13:35:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10180#comments:id=1588148",
        },
        {
            id = 211569,
            score = 9,
            author = "31800",
            text = "OK ... if you've never been to Auchindoun ... you can land at 44,64 on top of the steps near a couple of Bonethrashers. No NPC here. He is down below in the ruins, directly beneath the steps, at the same coords. There is a central entrance, as well as one off to each side. Enter the central entrance to find Isfar. Hope this saves some time!",
            date = "2008-01-02T12:04:01-06:00",
