            score = 5,
            author = "51076",
            text = "Both these mob types are immune to Arcane Shot and for all you hunters out there Viper sting doesn't work either. All of those who use mana best stock up on fluids these mobs do suck ya dry of mana.",
            date = "2007-05-26T19:28:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10185#comments:id=91269",
        },
        {
            id = 254751,
