            text = "(57, 87) is where i found the mobs.  Easy to pull just one, and they die quickly.  Beware because they mana-burn.   Mobs right around quest giver and the drop Motes of Mana which sell for alot.  I ended up with 3 Primal Manas by the end of the quest (45g right there).",
            date = "2008-03-17T11:15:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10185#comments:id=254751",
