        },
        {
            id = 2298596,
            score = 14,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_OoAD5B3-34\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10188\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10188, from the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644, which can be summoned by clicking on the https://www.wowhead.com/item=28455 you were provided.\n•\009Travel to the area of coords 52, 81.\n•\009Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19593 and loot the https://www.wowhead.com/item=28368 from her corpse.\n•\009Use your https://www.wowhead.com/item=28455, and turn in the quest to the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644.\n\nNOTE: If you have https://www.wowhead.com/item=118191 in your collection, you can use this to summon https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644.\n\nThank you Elfizm for this information",
            date = "2016-01-15T16:07:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10188#comments:id=2298596",
        },
        {
            id = 224640,
            score = 13,
            author = "Pikestaff",
            text = "If you get there just as somebody else is killing/has killed Spellbinder Maryana, don't worry-- that happened to me too, and her respawn time seems to be about three or four minutes or so.\n\nOh and for the record, the \"Krasus\" referred to in the quest text, is the dragon mage Korialstrasz from the Warcraft novels by Richard A. Knaak. =D",
            date = "2008-01-26T17:52:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10188#comments:id=224640",
        },
    },
