            text = "If you have turned in the quest Report to Spymaster Thalodien  (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11039) and he doesn't give you this quest \"Manaforge B'naar\" then go to Shaterath City and make sure you have done the quest Allegiance to the Scryers  (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10552)",
