            text = "found the warp-masters and warp-engineers inside the main building.  The geologists were outside, east of the building, around 26, 74.",
            date = "2007-02-19T12:12:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10193#comments:id=38692",
