            author = "g0jack",
            text = "At the time that I did it, Engineers were hard to find. They ARE in that area, however. They are around the beam connected to the large pipe that is hooked up to the Manaforge.",
            date = "2007-02-07T21:06:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10193#comments:id=32432",
        },
        {
            id = 106505,
            score = 7,
            author = "Cybersonix",
            text = "The masters and engineers are inside the big building. The Geologist are outside mostly under the big beam that comes out from the building, there are some Masters walking around there to.\nBuilding: around 23.70\nBig Beam: around 25.71\n\nThe engineers and masters does a channeling attack that does Nature dmg over time. And the Geologist throws some rock that does around 190dmg.",
            date = "2007-06-18T13:59:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10193#comments:id=106505",
        },
        {
            id = 187638,
            score = 7,
            author = "Motoki",
            text = "Be careful here, this is not an easy quest.  Geologists do appear to be linked to several Bloodwarders -- I didn't notice if they aggro'd the warders naturally, or if they summoned on a timer, but be prepared to take on 4-5 at once.  None of the elves seem to hit very hard, but they are very densely concentrated, and it is easy to get overwhelmed.  Pull carefully, and pay attention to the Warp-masters' patrol paths.",
            date = "2007-11-19T12:05:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10193#comments:id=187638",
        },
    },
