            text = "I find it amusingly ironic that you have to lay waste to the entire Manaforge Coruu staff to find:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=28635\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=28636\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=28637\nbecause of low droprates.\n\nOnly to use them to make a https://www.wowhead.com/item=28607 for the next quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10198.\nI guess we'll be using the element of surprise?",
