        {
            id = 24618,
            score = 35,
            author = "13645",
            text = "Please disregard my previous comment.  In order to recieve credit for this part you must be right on top of the two guards that are speaking to one another.  Do not worry about Pathaleon the Calculator's Image he is red but will not aggro",
            date = "2007-01-25T19:18:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10198#comments:id=24618",
        },
        {
            id = 28881,
            score = 28,
            author = "18707",
            text = "Just watch for the arcane annihilator and you'll be fine. I had to solo it, and thankfully I was a lock.\n\nThe guys are in the south wing of the mana forge, I walked right up to them, they had a conversation, and the quest was completed. 10 mins is plenty of time.",
            date = "2007-02-01T11:26:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10198#comments:id=28881",
        },
        {
            id = 119406,
            score = 16,
            author = "20161",
            text = "Before you turn-in quest, use cloak one more time. You won't need to fight your way through all mobs to do followup quest.",
            date = "2007-07-12T06:12:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10198#comments:id=119406",
        },
        {
            id = 290479,
            score = 11,
            author = "Chiisai",
            text = "Commander Dawnforge says: We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis. This is not a request, it's an order.\nArcanist Ardonis says: You cannot be serious!  We are severely understaffed and can barely keep this manaforge functional!\nCommander Dawnforge says: You will do as ordered.  Manaforge Duro has come under heavy attack by mana creatures and the situation is out of control.  Failure to comply will not be tolerated!\nPathaleon the Calculator's Image says: Indeed, it is not a request.\nCommander Dawnforge says: My lord!\nPathaleon the Calculator's Image says: Duro will be reinforced!  Ultris was a complete disaster.  I will NOT have that mistake repeated!\nPathaleon the Calculator's Image says: We've had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  PRince Kael'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!\nPathaleon the Calculator's Image says: I am returning to Tempest Keep.  See to it that I do not have reason to return!\nCommander Dawnforge says: Yes, my lord.\nArcanist Ardonis says: Yes, my lord.\nCommander Dawnforge says: See to it, Ardonis!",
            date = "2008-05-18T14:42:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10198#comments:id=290479",
        },
    },
