    [10205] = {
        {
            id = 33965,
            score = 337,
            author = "3316",
            text = "1. Assisting the Consortium [Level 68] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10264, a 'go talk to' quest (1200XP/72s)\n2. Consortium Crystal Collection [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10265, kill a dreadlord called Pentatharon and get a crystal from him\n3. A Heap of Ethereals [Level 68] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262 , repeatable quest also for Consortium reputation.\n\n1st chain ends here : 25800XP, 510 Consortium reputation OR around 15g at 70\nThis is where you are :\n4. Warp-Raider Nesaad [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10205, a go-kill-him quest.\n5. Request for Assistance [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10266 , find Gahruj at 47,57\n6. Rightful Repossession [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10267 , get 10 boxes from around Mana Forge: Duro\n7. An Audience with the Prince [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10268 , Nexus-Prince Haramad at 44,35 or so in the Stormspire.\n8. Triangulation Point One [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10269 , use the Triangulation Device at 66, 33\n9. Triangulation Point Two [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10275 , same thing at 28,41\n10. Full Triangle [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10276 , Find Culuthas at 53, 21, 70 Elite demon.\n\n2nd chain ends here: 1600 Consortium reputation, 71450 XP or around 60 gold if you're 70.\n\n11. Special Delivery to Shattrath [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10280 , pretty obvious.\n12. How To Break Into the Arcatraz [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10704 , the Bottom Shard of the Arcatraz Key : Pathaleon the Calculator in The Mechanar and the Top Shard of the Arcatraz Key : Warp Splinter in The Botanica. Pretty obvious if you know where they're located, huh.\n\nThe quest chain doesn't stop here, there's also\n13. Harbinger of Doom [Level 70] after : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10882\n\nAfter this 3rd quest chain, you get around 40g and your Key to the Arcatraz : http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31084",
            date = "2007-02-11T07:17:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10205#comments:id=33965",
        },
        {
            id = 24352,
            score = 78,
            author = "Wealth",
            text = "Found him at 28, 80.\n\nHe got 2 guards, if you got behind him and pull the left guard, he and only the left guard comes.",
