        {
            id = 165491,
            score = 350,
            author = "29438",
            text = "Quick Fact\nThe entire tour takes 08:30min. from accept to objective complete.",
            date = "2007-10-10T06:50:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10211#comments:id=165491",
        },
        {
            id = 1033536,
            score = 312,
            author = "576760",
            text = "Solod this on my prot warrior. Some tips:\n1. When you get to the dragon, make sure you keep spell reflect up the second its on cooldown, and always silence if he's about to cast shadowblast.\n2. AoE would greatly help when you get to the refugee adds, nothing big, they go down pretty fast.\n3. For the last phase, I had to pop last stand and shield wall. After he finishes enraging, he's a piece of cake.\n\nThis elemental was a horrible tank, couldn't keep threat at all.",
            date = "2010-05-05T23:41:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10211#comments:id=1033536",
        },
        {
            id = 1297750,
            score = 296,
            author = "469573",
            text = "Khadgar's Servant walks at an extremely irritating speed somewhere between run and RP-walk, making the auto-run key useless and your attempts to follow him bursty.  Run ahead, wait, run ahead, wait.\n\nIf you want to match his pace the only way I found to do it was to ride my ground mount\n\n...backwards.",
            date = "2011-01-17T12:07:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10211#comments:id=1297750",
        },
    },
