        {
            id = 110173,
            score = 12,
            author = "57456",
            text = "By doing this quest i found out a few things that might help you.\n1.the casters, the guys are ice mages the girls are fire mages.\n2. the knights that r out where the footmen are ligned up will charge u but the 1`s where the buildings and stuff are don`t charge you.\n3. there are random ghosts walking arround that won`t atack you and there`s a guy in 1 of the towers that won`t atack you either.\n\nthe plants for that quest u do for that orc sitting down spaun where the footmen are ligned up and the respaun rate is pritty fast so u caan kill footmen then get the plant\n\nthat`s really the only important things i`ve learned doing this",
            date = "2007-06-24T04:00:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10220#comments:id=110173",
        },
        {
            id = 20764,
            score = 10,
            author = "10501",
            text = "Be wary of the knights. They charge on initial agro and call for help from surrounding mobs.",
            date = "2007-01-16T03:59:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10220#comments:id=20764",
        },
        {
