            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S2ykPI-mvD8\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10225\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10225, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570 at coords 32.6, 64.4 (Area 52).\n•\009Travel south, while still in Area 52, to coords 32.4, 66.6.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19709.",
            date = "2016-01-15T16:20:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10225#comments:id=2298617",
        },
    },
    [10226] = {
        {
            id = 22232,
            score = 990,
            author = "12909",
            text = "After you zapped and killed either a Rumbler or Abberation look on the ground for a blue shard, it's not on the killed mob itself.",
            date = "2007-01-20T19:11:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10226#comments:id=22232",
        },
        {
            id = 2335068,
            score = 125,
            author = "VijoPlaysOnYT",
            text = "Just to anyone that is wondering:\n\n1. Use the extractor.\n2. Kill the elemental.\n3. Loot a little crystal that spawns above their corpse.\n\nSo there's no need to get them to a certain percentage, i.e. kill yourself with rezz debuff in order to hit them for nothing.",
            date = "2016-05-28T17:29:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10226#comments:id=2335068",
        },
        {
            id = 26619,
            score = 68,
            author = "15629",
            text = "So you walk up to a Warp Abberation (very close). You right click your Elemental Power Extractor, the mob hits you but the cast is uninterupted. The mob gets a blue gas glow. You kill him and he drops a blue crystal. You right click it and collect the Elemental power.\n\nSame thing on the Sundered Rumbler except after you kill it, it spawns another smaller mob (Rumbler shard) with the blue crystall. Kill the add collect the crystal.\n\n32,77 area\n\ngl",
            date = "2007-01-28T19:36:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10226#comments:id=26619",
        },
        {
            id = 25524,
            score = 43,
            author = "16133",
            text = "You can find them around 36, 78 south of area 52 by the cliff edge.",
            date = "2007-01-27T05:52:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10226#comments:id=25524",
        },
        {
            id = 28192,
            score = 31,
            author = "15689",
            text = "Sundered Rumbler : http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18881\nWarp Aberration : http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18865",
            date = "2007-01-31T09:29:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10226#comments:id=28192",
        },
    },
