        },
        {
            id = 2511834,
            score = 13,
            author = "Downhitted",
            text = "Since there is clearly no information given on this of where to start and the page seems rather unfinished, I did some research to find out myself, as the 4th and 5th quest of total 6 in this series, counts towards the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1192 achievement, (where I happened to be missing out on 2 and I couldn't pick up any other quests in [zone=3518] itself).\n\nAnyways, this quests is started by a level 10 Draenei boy named https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19697. He stands inside the hallway of the front of the entrance to [zone=3790], Auchindoun, [zone=3519], (west entrance).\n\nStarting out with this page's quest, the series is:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10227\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10228\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10231\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10251\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10252\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10253",
            date = "2017-08-03T20:04:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10227#comments:id=2511834",
        },
        {
            id = 52964,
            score = 10,
            author = "qwksilver",
            text = "This quest chain leades to http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10252 which is the prereq for being able to see and use the repair vendor outside crypts.",
            date = "2007-03-18T01:51:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10227#comments:id=52964",
        },
    },
