        {
            id = 2540423,
            score = 11,
            author = "meluksetich",
            text = "If, like me, you are trying to complete your collections, you won't pick up this tome until you've started or completed the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10220.  Since https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10220 didn't reward anything I needed I thought I could skip it.",
