            author = "Murcielago",
            text = "Confirmed!\n\nthe parts are around the place at 51,54 and dont bother killing humanoids there because they dont drop.\n\nWhile your at it do the quest\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10232 and its about killing\n15 Mo'arg engineer and by the way these humanoids respwan fast, and 5 of them Gan'arg Doomsmith but im not sure how fast they respwan\n\ngood luck",
            date = "2007-04-14T11:14:41-05:00",
