            text = "The Scrap fields are just Southwest of Eco-Dome Midrealm. It shouldn't be long before you find a field with the technicians. The parts are lying on the ground next to the abanded parts. Quickly respawns, so if you don't feel like dealing with mobs, stay in one spot.",
            date = "2007-07-26T18:55:19-05:00",
