            author = "Tyrsenus",
            text = "\"I sure hope my cousin, Screed Luckheed, crashes that stupid zeppelin of his.  I can't believe he tricked me into coming to Outland.\"\nTurns out Screed (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19367) does crash his zepplin.",
