            text = "This quest can be completed inside the manaforge b'naar at : 23.1 , 68.3.\nIt's a big purple crystal and should be easy to locate. It's a complete-and-get-new-quest at the same spot and there''s no \"cast-time\" to use the crystal, meaning you can complete it while being hit by the guards since it can't be interrupted (just in case you're in short time).\n\nReturn to Area 52 after you have accepted your new quest.\n(this is the Aldor chain and therefore it will decrease your Scryer rep.)\n\nGood Luck",
