            text = "The above location worked for me. When you blow the horn, Urtak will show up and attack you. I didn't have time to stealth, as a rogue. He doesn't hit too hard, but he seems to have an absolute ton of hit points, so it's a good thing that a whole swarm of ghosts come help you kill him. Quite nice of them, really. :)",
