    [10253] = {
        {
            id = 1712967,
            score = 93,
            author = "HalfPintGnome",
            text = "I was leveling up my archaeology in Auchindoun, when I happened to land next to this guy. Since I had Dark Apotheosis active, I was in demon form and could read demonic. Needless to say, I was a bit surprised to see the translation! Here is what this guy is saying for all of you non-warlocks:\n\nLevixus says: [Demonic] Shane Dabiri, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B., A. Mayberry!\n\nScott Mercer! Geoff, Wyatt, Joe, Travis, Kris, Steven! Brazie!\n\nJordan and Jonathan LeCraft!\n\nJustin Thavirat! Roman Kenney! Our entire awesome art and animation team!\n\nLuis, Brianna and Eric! Blizzard QA team! Of course our fans!\n\nCHRIS METZEN!\n\nPat Nagle! World design team! Cory Stockton, Paul C., Jim Chadwick, Staats, Ed Hanes, Morris, Gotcher, Jesse!, Sarah B., Victor C., Dave A.! All  of our amazing exterior artists!\n\nJeffery Kaplan! Tom Chilton! Rob Pardo!\n\nI think I wrote down all of them, and even recognize a few of those names. ;-)",
