        {
            id = 32177,
            score = 7,
            author = "21368",
            text = "You can really quite easily get the following quests done at the same time:\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10233\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10222",
            date = "2007-02-07T10:30:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301#comments:id=32177",
        },
        {
            id = 2298576,
            score = 7,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nvsM-dmc5Zo\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301, from the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644 (you can summon him by clicking on the https://www.wowhead.com/item=28455, you were provided).\n•\009Travel north, to Sunfury Hold, to the area of coords 55, 79.\n•\009Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19926, and loot the https://www.wowhead.com/item=28475 from her corpse (she does patrol through the Sunfury Hold area).\n•\009Turn in the quest by using your https://www.wowhead.com/item=28455, to summon the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644.\n\nNOTE: If you have https://www.wowhead.com/item=118191 in your collection, you can use this to summon https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19644.\n\nThank you Elfizm for this information",
            date = "2016-01-15T15:48:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301#comments:id=2298576",
        },
        {
            id = 2079926,
            score = 6,
            author = "SyCx1",
            text = "If you are a warlock at high level that for whatever reason picked this quest chain up from that stupid toy.. beware.. your pets WILL kill things before you can and you will NOT get credit for the kill and must wait the 5-10 minutes for respawn. Totally lame. Blizzard still hasn't fixed pet tagging even after 10+ years apparently.",
            date = "2014-12-31T17:05:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301#comments:id=2079926",
        },
        {
            id = 23774,
            score = 5,
            author = "13573",
            text = "She walks around sunfury hold in the middle, clear adds out of the way before fighting since that place is kinda a mess if your not careful.",
            date = "2007-01-24T14:30:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10301#comments:id=23774",
        },
    },
