        {
            id = 2358746,
            score = 7,
            author = "Medusachick",
            text = "I have killed over 30 spawns without one drop, I waited until they turned to ghosts or spectres, I tried killing them with the soulbind and without. I have relogged and abandoned and retaken the quest a few times.  I saw on Battlenet that someone else was having this problem as of 1 day ago and am curious if anyone else is having issues? I'm about to submit a report to Blizzard, but that takes a few days for a response nowadays.  Hoping I missed something to resolve faster.",
            date = "2016-07-30T02:42:15-05:00",
