        {
            id = 282596,
            score = 20,
            author = "92167",
            text = "Just to warn you, he has a 10 minute respawn timer.\n\nI know this because some jerk from the other faction on a PvE server came up behind me (after I'd cleared the entire tunnel) while I was eating and drinking prior to engaging him, and he stole my kill (then turned around, /pointed, /laughed, and ran off.)\n\nHe respawned 10 minutes later, to the second.  So, make sure you tag him, or look over your shoulder.  10 minutes is a ridiculously long time to sit there and fume.",
            date = "2008-05-04T23:42:18-05:00",
