            author = "tibbsy",
            text = "Keep in mind that when you look at the drop rate %'s for each of the quest items - http://www.wowhead.com/?item=29545 and http://www.wowhead.com/?item=29546 - that many people killing the Sunfury Centurions, Bowmen and Conjurers may not have had the quest to gather these items. Thus, the drop rates would be skewed much lower than they actually are.\n\nI killed probably 5-10 Conjurers and 5-10 Bowmen and had both quest items.",
