            text = "if you head to eastern side of manaforge (62,66) you'll find a line of 5 bowmen next to a tunnel entrance to forge itself.easy to farm here then nip inside for centurions while they respawn as this tunnel doesnt have those annoying nether beasts in it and its straight forward, stress free killing with no fear of adds etc.",
