    [10333] = {
        {
            id = 632109,
            score = 63,
            author = "332728",
            text = "For the Help Mama Wheeler chain you must first..\nDo the Etheral Tech quest from the Etheral inside Area 52 ((Don't have to do both))\nDo the Pick your part Quest from Pappa Wheeler\nThen you should be able to accept the Help Mama Wheeler quest chain.",
            date = "2009-03-05T10:44:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333#comments:id=632109",
        },
        {
            id = 2336763,
            score = 40,
            author = "albinoette",
            text = "Mini-Guide for https://www.wowhead.com/item=134021 (Legion toy), previously https://www.wowhead.com/item=30847 (head armor).\n\nRewarded from https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10249, the final quest in a 7-part quest chain, all taking place in Netherstorm, Outland.\n\nIf you have destroyed your helmet:\nAs of 6.2.3, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570 has the dialog option: \"Chief, I've somehow misplaced my X-52 Rocket Helmet!\" to which he replies \"Well, alright then, there you go, First Officer . Just try to be more careful with your helmet in the future. Those things don't grow on trees, you know!\" and gives you a new helmet.\n[hr]\nIf you cannot get the initial quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19645, you need to complete these pre-quests:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10265 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19880 which, once complete, will let you pick up  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10206 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19645.\n[hr]\nAnd now you can...\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333 - Fly to Eco-Dome Midrealm and talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19728 at 46.63 56.53. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19728/mama-wheeler#map))\nShe will offer https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10234.\n - Collect https://www.wowhead.com/object=183935 at The Scrap Fields, just southeast of Mama at/around 49.27 59.77. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/object=183935/fel-reaver-part#map)) Be warned if you are doing this quest at level: the surrounding mobs have a dynamite attack at low health.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10235\n - Obtain https://www.wowhead.com/item=28563 from killing/looting https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19738 to the east at 50.69 57.19. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19738/doomclaw#map))\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10237 - Return to Area 52 and speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570 under the rocket at 32.72 64.97. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570/rocket-chief-fuselage#map))\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10247 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19832 at 37.27 63.69. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19832/doctor-vomisa-ph-t#map))\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10248 (At level: Suggested Players [3].)\n - It appears you cannot do this quest if someone outside your party is already on it, as I was given the error \"Requires Uncontrolled Scrap Reaver X6000\" while someone else was controlling one.\n- Soon after using the provided https://www.wowhead.com/item=28634, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19851 (69 elite) will start running at you from the location marked on your minimap (near the bridge around 40.48 62.61). He stops just outside Doctor Vomisha's camp at 37.72 63.46. Watch for him to come running.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=10249 - Return to Area 52 and speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570 who has moved slightly north of the rocket at 32.69 64.42. (map (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19570/rocket-chief-fuselage#map))\n\n[hr]\nCongratulations on your new X-52 Rocket Helmet!\n[hr]\nRazerWolf came up with a great macro here (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30847/x-52-rocket-helmet#comments:id=223483) (will need to be tested once this item is a toy instead of a helm), that simulates a problem with your mount (/panic /emote slams the ejector button!) and ejects you (/dismount /use X-52 Rocket Helmet). He/She also notes that \"the Parachute effect only works to the height you blasted off from, so if you're too high up you might still kill yourself.\"\n[hr]",
            date = "2016-06-03T17:23:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333#comments:id=2336763",
        },
        {
            id = 34442,
            score = 21,
            author = "11267",
            text = "Confirmed.  I completed Pick your Part and not Wanted:Annihilator Servo and as soon as I turned in Pick Your Part the Mama Wheeler quest became available.  (This is at level 68.)",
            date = "2007-02-12T02:52:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333#comments:id=34442",
        },
        {
            id = 2298589,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dFUjNk0vrBs\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19645 at coords 32.8, 64.6 (Area 52).\n•\009Travel northeast, to Eco-Dome Midrealm, to coords 46.6, 56.4.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19728.",
            date = "2016-01-15T16:02:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10333#comments:id=2298589",
        },
        {
            id = 26986,
            score = 0,
