        {
            id = 115058,
            score = 49,
            author = "SteelBlade",
            text = "OK just confirmed this. This quest needs lvl 70.\n\nI tried to get this quest at level 69 but i couldnt. You would get a silver ! (which as always it means there is a quest here but you are to low level for it).\n\nI did no other quest and came back to Commander Ameer on level 70 and the quest was available to me. I also was neutral with the consortium.\n\nThe information listed here for level 68 requirement is false. It might have been change with the patch, which makes some sense to me since the rewards are a bit OP for a lvl 68 to have.\n\nRegards",
            date = "2007-07-03T14:17:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10339#comments:id=115058",
        },
        {
            id = 139943,
            score = 12,
            author = "80298",
            text = "I'm going to confirm the level requirement as well.\n\nA Game Master told me that the level requirement of this chain quest was level 70.\n\nSo, they probably changed it. Which means I lost about 50-60k experience..",
            date = "2007-08-18T06:52:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10339#comments:id=139943",
        },
        {
            id = 660221,
