            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l_6tBVrn490\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10340\n•\009Accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10340 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19310 at coords 71.2, 62.6 (Expedition Point).\n•\009Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19409 (coords: 71.4, 62.4) and select, \"Send me to Shatter Point.\"\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20234, right when you land, at coords 78.4, 35.",
