            author = "13072",
            text = "They're both at around 82, 36. I got my 5 Withered Bog Lord Sample in about 10-15 mins, but the Parched Hydra Sample took over 30 mins to get all five. Parched Hydra got a lower drop rate.\n\nPS they only from the Withered Bog Lord and Parched Hydra don't waste your time with the other mobs there :)",
