            text = "This is a good quest to do if you later want to get reputation with the Sporeggar.\nAnd in that case, kill everything you see, even the smaller Withered Giants.",
            date = "2007-07-19T11:49:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10355#comments:id=123338",
        },
        {
            id = 906497,
            score = 4,
            author = "ihateblizzdev",
            text = "Considering the atrocious drop rate, you'd think there would be a decent reward for the grind.  The tendrils and motes are nice, but don't justify the amount of time spent grinding vs. reward.\n\nI'd say skip this - it's classic Blizz time-waste.  If you do it, do it later (as stated above) for rep with Sporereggar.",
            date = "2009-12-04T17:33:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10355#comments:id=906497",
        },
    },
