            text = "If you have problems finding Mo'arg Warp-Master  there are a lot of them inside the Manaforge Ara building.",
            date = "2007-04-14T08:00:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10380#comments:id=67037",
        },
        {
            id = 821565,
