            text = "Oh, and tell that pasty-faced shield-kisser I said 'hello'.\n\n:O  I won't even ask...",
            date = "2008-09-15T18:20:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10382#comments:id=377369",
        },
    },
