            text = "You need to first get the Warden's Key from the Warden, near the pink spheres section. (55,40) Then use the Key on Captain Tyralius's Prison at 52,42.",
            date = "2007-01-27T12:20:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10422#comments:id=25714",
