        {
            id = 37509,
            score = 80,
            author = "Amok",
            text = "It seems the only way you can start this quest is by saving the Captured Protectorate Vanguard when he is fighting the gladiator.  After killing the gladiator you will then see the vanguard has a quest for you.   You can only do it when he fights the gladiator also. any other mobs and he just despawns.",
