            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1j0S9AHfDY0\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10425\n•\009Travel to the Ethereum Staging Grounds, in [zone=3523], to coords 56, 37.\n•\009Locate an https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20452 near those coords and wait for it to say, \"Bring out the gladiator!\"  In less than two minutes, an https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20854 yells, \"Time for the pain!\" and the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20763 will appear (forum posts appear to suggest that the quest giver has an approximate 7 minute respawn timer).\n•\009Help the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20763 kill the loudmouth https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20452.\n•\009At this point the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20763 will offer you a quest.  Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10425.\n•\009Escort the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20763 out of the Ethereum Staging Grounds, and northeast, back to the Protectorate Watch Post at coords 59.4, 32.2.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20448.",
