            author = "devolore",
            text = "He doesn't move, so ranged dps can burn him down easily. Melees will have to stand \"inside\" of him to hit him. He spawns little tentacles on the ground that will knock you back if you get near them (kind of like C'thun on a much much smaller scale).",
