            text = "If you are a ranged class that has an ability to increase the range of your spells or attacks (I.E. priests' Holy/Shadow Reach, hunters' Hawk Eye, etc.), stand on the eastern bank at (45, 27).  Since the hydra doesn't move, you'll be able to attack the hydra without it attacking you with its Venom Spit.",
