        {
            id = 217125,
            score = 6,
            author = "117351",
            text = "You need to do these quests before you can talk to Audi the Needle:\n\n\"Keeping Up Appearances\"\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10433\n\nAfter that you will get this quest which will lead you to Audi:\n\n\"The Dynamic Duo\"\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10434\n\nThen you will be offered \"Retrieving the Goods\"\n\nWatch out for a named Tyrannosaurus that stomps around the same area as the raptors nests. He's lvl 71 (non-elite) but has tons of hit points and does huge damage. I was getting Un'goro flashbacks.",
            date = "2008-01-12T06:01:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10435#comments:id=217125",
        },
        {
            id = 47411,
            score = 2,
            author = "Ambushed",
            text = "\"Loc 44 14\nalso quest: All clear! in this area\"\n\"I'd make sure you do the quest All Clear! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10436), they just work well together.\"\n\"You should do the Diagnosis: Critical Q (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10424) first, since the last quest is to deliver something then you get the q to kill the raptors.\"\n\nThank you. Comments like this are awesome",
            date = "2007-03-07T00:22:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10435#comments:id=47411",
        },
    },
