        },
        {
            id = 136606,
            score = 17,
            author = "73537",
            text = "=========================================================\nHorde Report – The Kaoethiel Experience\n=========================================================\n\nQuest Giver Location: 44.7,14.5 – Located VERY North West of map.  On your main map, you will see the Field Areas (Located with Green Terrain).  This quest is located in the Very North Field.\nActual Quest Location: Raptors Located in View from Quest Giver – North of Him.\nQuest Giver Name: Tashar – Consortium Humanoid\nQuest Chain Starting Quest: Run a Diagnostic! – Located In Eco-Dome Midrealm\nFollowing quest:  “Success!” – Return to Stormspire\nRecommended Level: Raptors For this quest are level 68-69 so a Level 67 could do it if they wanted.\n\nQuest Notes: The goal of this quest is to kill 12 raptors.  Raptors are in plain view from quest giver.\n\nAlliance Watch: LOW  - Way up in the corner of the map, not once on any of my character have I had an alliance problem on this quest, Ever.\nQuest Rank of Ease: Very Easy.\n\n******Questions? Comments?  Want a Quest Reviewed and Posted?  Email me!  Chrism0221@gmail.com*******",
            date = "2007-08-12T17:09:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10436#comments:id=136606",
        },
        {
            id = 74499,
            score = 3,
            author = "5353",
            text = "Good amount 44.11",
            date = "2007-04-28T16:06:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10436#comments:id=74499",
        },
