            text = "Trio this quest with War on the Warmaul and Finding the Survivors. All three quests take you to Warmaul hill(links to quests not available at time of post). These particular beads dropped about once per every four kills.\n\nRepeatable upon completion",
            date = "2006-12-10T14:28:36-06:00",
