        {
            id = 276968,
            score = 6,
            author = "134346",
            text = "So, here's the lazy man's way:\n\nI rode my mount (epic, and with the Crusader Aura on) straight into the compound and up to the fortress. I then ran past all the mobs into his room. I promptly died, since I had four on me. Then I ran back as a ghost, got into a corner and drank/ate up, got my buffs up, and then took him easily.\n\nOnce done, I hearthed back to Shattrath. Not great if you want to avoid the repair bill, but it was a lot faster than dealing with mobs trying to get to him.",
            date = "2008-04-24T18:21:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10485#comments:id=276968",
        },
    },
