        {
            id = 1650372,
            score = 22,
            author = "886000",
            text = "Here are the list of quests I had to complete to unlock this quest (in order of completion):\n1. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13618\n2. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33294 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13619\n3. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13620\n4. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33263 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13621\n5. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33284 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13628\n6. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13640\n7. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13651\n8. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13653\n\nBug Warning\nThe following quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712 is bugged (as of the patch this was posted, Patch 4.3.3).\n\nWork around\nFollow skarpethinn's intructions in the comments on https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712 . This method has been tested successfully by myself.\n\n9. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712\n10. Npc: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33837 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13803\n\nAfter completing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13803 , The first quest in this series (Npc: Splintertree Demolisher https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33726 , Quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13730 ) will be unlocked.\nHope this helps :) , Please excuse the wall of text and let me know if I need to change anything.",
            date = "2012-04-07T23:30:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13798#comments:id=1650372",
        },
    },
