            text = "As Dawnraid said, look for the little + on your minimap when you get near the co ords. Also, when the blood drops inside the cave end do not (I repeat DO NOT) jump down the bottom of the platform.\n\nThe heart was directly above my head so I didn't see it initially.\n\nHope the screenshots I took help.",
            date = "2011-01-09T10:47:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13805#comments:id=1285637",
