            text = "The protectors are standing next to little pavilions around the lumber camp. Co-ords for each on is as follows;\nProtector Endolar (85,56)\nProtector Arminon (85,58)\nProtector Dorinar (85,60)\nThe Ashenvale Scouts are scattered all over the place in between each protector. You can also do the quest \"Making Stumps (http://cata.wowhead.com/quest=13815#comments:id=1076497)\" while doing this one.\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
