        {
            id = 2016935,
            score = 17,
            author = "BlizzardCS",
            text = "UPDATE: We didn't get any further report, so it seems like the issue is indeed totally fixed. Thanks all for your patience and understanding while we were working on it.\n\nUPDATE 11/11/2014: This issue should be fixed by now. Please, if you are still experiencing this issue let us know so we can look into it. :)\n\nAt the moment there’s an issue with this quest. The item https://www.wowhead.com/item=46352 is not casting the appropriate spell. Due to this it’s not possible to fill the https://www.wowhead.com/object=195002 and complete the quest. Our development team is aware of the situation, so this should get fixed in the future. :)",
            date = "2014-10-21T12:08:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13880#comments:id=2016935",
        },
        {
            id = 1212981,
            score = 11,
            author = "517876",
            text = "Thank you, thank you, thank you.  This is a very important bit of info for us high levels doing loremaster, who may not always take the time to check corpses.  This proveided the last chain I needed to finish Ashenvale.",
            date = "2010-12-07T19:46:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13880#comments:id=1212981",
        },
        {
            id = 1190133,
            score = 7,
            author = "cuppa",
