            text = "The bug appears to be with the DOT damage.  If the quest boss dies to dot damage you may not get credit.\n\nI did the abandon+retry after each failed attempt just to be sure...and I tested it with Lightning Kill , DOT Kill and Manual Kill (flying up and killing it)\n\nOnly way I ever got credit was from Lighting Kill...so widdle him down to 10% then just kill with Lighting Attack (1 on Vehicle bar)",
            date = "2011-03-20T16:00:32-05:00",
