            text = "EDIT: READ BELOW!\n\nThis quest seems to be broken at the moment, either that or I am missing something crucial... The item is gone (thought the quest doesn't call for it to complete) and Pelturas Whitemoon doesn't complete the quest. Submitted as a bug but I'm not sure if it's just me being stupid or it's being purposely cryptic...\n\nI have discovered that right now many quest addons that change the default quest tracking UI element do not play well with the new remote quest turn-in feature that pops up for some quests. As of right now you will have to disable your quest addon (or fix it yourself) to get quests like this one to work properly! Again: This is NOT a bug with the quest, but with an addon!",
