        {
            id = 1200521,
            score = 23,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "Questtwig: Healing the Child\n\nBathran's Hair (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26473)\nDelivery for Orendil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13623)\nBathed in Light (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13642)\nOrendil's Cure (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474)\nElune's Tear (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26475)\nA Trip to the Moonwell (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13919)\nHe Who Would Be Forgiven (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13921) OR He Who Would Be Forgiven (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14018)(Given if you abandon first)\nIn the Hands of the Perverse (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13922)\nAll's Well (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924)",
            date = "2010-12-01T15:37:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1200521",
        },
        {
            id = 1333840,
            score = 13,
            author = "LafinJack",
            text = "Would have been better if they'd given her a night elf child model instead of a regular adult night elf one. And her shirt color makes her look topless. :o",
            date = "2011-02-12T21:54:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1333840",
        },
        {
            id = 1200308,
            score = 7,
            author = "Haxan",
            text = "This must be the finest, most touching quest line in Wow.",
            date = "2010-12-01T13:50:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1200308",
        },
        {
            id = 1507176,
            score = 3,
            author = "448060",
            text = "This must be the finest, most touching quest line in Wow.\n\nNo it's not! We are doing something evil here! The questgiver (Pelturas Whitemoon (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3894)) is a monster! I wish he was flagged differently so I could beat him up.\n\nHe's been trying to \"cure\" Relara (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3892) since before Cata. There's even a comic about (http://www.darklegacycomics.com/231.html) it. Really what's he's doing is poisoning his daughter to make her sick. Remember the movie Six Sense where the mother was putting drain cleaner into her food? That's what you are helping him do by doing this questline.\n\nIn the Münchausen by Proxy syndrome (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%BCnchausen_syndrome_by_proxy), an adult care-giver makes a child sick by either fabricating symptoms or actually causing harm to the child whereby convincing not only the child but others, including medical providers, that their child is sick.\n\nThis info used to be in the notes of the old pre-Cata questline, but I can't find it.",
            date = "2011-08-31T01:02:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1507176",
        },
        {
            id = 1600274,
            score = 2,
            author = "115749",
            text = "BUG:  I was unable to turn this quest in.  I had the Moonstones in my bag, but there was no question mark above Pelturas Whitemoon's head.  It showed a question mark on my mini map in his location, but like I said, when I clicked on him, he would not speak to me.  Not sure what happened, but I eventually just had to abandon the quest.",
            date = "2011-12-22T10:21:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1600274",
        },
    },
