            text = "This quest is missing/bugged/unavailable, still, 24th of June 2025, patch 11.1.7 (The War Within). This quest does not seem to always appear, but the next step should be available from Benjari Edune (17,49) (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=24739/benjari-edune) (Three Friends of the Forest (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13976/three-friends-of-the-forest)). The NPC is not always marked on the map either, even when tracking low level quests - or being level appropriate.",
