    [24463] = {
        {
            id = 1644184,
            score = 23,
            author = "968976",
            text = "Note to clear up confusion as to why people seem to not be able to get this quest:\n\n*There is no high level limit on this quest nor its followup.\n\n*The prerequisite quest is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24439\n\nThere are four reasons you will be unable to get this quest...\n\n1. You have in your log or have completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28493\n2. You have in your log or have completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13866\n3. You have in your log or have completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13612\n4. You have not yet completed the prerequisite quest\n\n*Together this two part series awards almost 10x as much xp as the Command Board version, so they are superior for both leveling toons, and leveled Lormasters for whom the WCC is unavailable.",
