            text = "You may wish to keep this quest in your questlog if you're not yet finished with astranaar or the quests at the raynewood retreat as the elekk can go very fast and you can exit at any point in the way, making it much better than your mount at lvl 20+.",
            date = "2015-03-22T20:22:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26453#comments:id=2141944",
        },
        {
