    [26474] = {
        {
            id = 1583837,
            score = 17,
            author = "petre",
            text = "Dunno if this is something that just started in 4.3, but I am unable to interact with Pelturas to turn in the quest.",
            date = "2011-11-29T22:11:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474#comments:id=1583837",
        },
        {
            id = 1591275,
            score = 7,
            author = "Snooops",
            text = "I made an account here just so I can share this with you guys, lol.\n\nI had exactly the same problem.. And I waited for a GM to respond on my ticket for 3 days...\n\nBut when I read the former comment, a friend of me went on his Horde char and killed it.. So it \"resets\". P.S. It spawns back very fast. :)\n\nSo, just let a Hordie kill it, and you can deliver your quest.\nHowever it needed to be killed again for me to get the other quests from him.\n\nMade it able for me to complete the Loremaster!",
            date = "2011-12-06T10:38:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474#comments:id=1591275",
        },
        {
            id = 1200505,
            score = 5,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "Questtwig: Healing the Child\n\nBathran's Hair (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26473)\nDelivery for Orendil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13623)\nBathed in Light (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13642)\nOrendil's Cure (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474)\nElune's Tear (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26475)\nA Trip to the Moonwell (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13919)\nHe Who Would Be Forgiven (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13921) OR He Who Would Be Forgiven (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14018)(Given if you abandon first)\nIn the Hands of the Perverse (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13922)\nAll's Well (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924)",
            date = "2010-12-01T15:34:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474#comments:id=1200505",
        },
        {
            id = 1591419,
            score = 3,
            author = "920127",
            text = "@Snoops. You beat me dude. Did exactly the same thing yesterday because of that post you saw as well.\n\nGet a friend who has a lvl 40 horde or higher to kill the the quest acceptor P. Whitemoon. When Whitemoon re-spawns, you will be able to turn in the quest. Then have your friend kill Whitemoon again to accept the next quest. After that, the rest of the quest chain is fine and not bugged. Cheers!\n\n(hopefully you will not have to do this as they are applying a HUGE update right now to 4.3, but just in case, here is how you beat it)",
            date = "2011-12-06T14:43:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474#comments:id=1591419",
        },
        {
            id = 1602980,
            score = 3,
            author = "487694",
            text = "No Game Master was on hand to reset this (it's probably quite common for them to be ticketed about it), however, after daily attempts to resume the quest line I came back at 9am (U.K. time) on a Wednesday (28 December) and was able to hand over the cure, which, after completing the follow up, also allowed me to pick up the Dartol's Rod quest chain from Raene Wolfrunner, which starts with Dryad Delivery (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26476). Ashenvale Loremaster would not have been possbible otherwise.\n\nIt needs to be said that it was not possible for me to turn this in yesterday (27 Dec), so it was not fixed before today (if it has been). I could see it was working before I got to Pelturas because the quest marker was ghosted to indicate that he was indoors, whereas it hadn't been on my previous visits.\n\nI can't say if this is the result of the regular reset or whether there has been a fix, but aside from downing Pelturas it may be prudent to revisit him on a Wednesday morning",
            date = "2011-12-28T03:58:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26474#comments:id=1602980",
        },
    },
