            author = "oakleafwolf",
            text = "The GMs are aware of the issues with the NPC for this quest. I just had a very helpful one port me back to Ashenvale and despawn the NPC for me so I could continue. The bug with him is that every time someone accepts/turns in a quest, he becomes uninteractable.\n\nIf you want to proceed on this quest without waiting 24+ hours for a GM to respond to a ticket, make/hire a Horde character high enough level to kill the NPC.\n\nThis should force him to respawn within 10 minutes and you can interact with the NPC again.",
