        {
            id = 1709390,
            score = 6,
            author = "QuickBASIC",
            text = "List of all the Warchief's Command breadcrumbs and the required level. Remember that none of these count for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7520 or associated achievements and are unavailable as soon as you start any chain in the zone it indicates.\n\nAs of 5.0.4 though, these quests give 60,000 guild exp (as does any level appropriate quest) so it may be worth while to come back and grab them as you are leveling when they come availible.\n[hr]\n\n[table]\n[tr][td align=left]Quest[/td][td align=left]Level[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28496[/td][td align=left]9[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28560[/td][td align=left]9[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28494[/td][td align=left]9[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28568[/td][td align=left]9[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26964 (given by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=1515)[/td][td align=left]9[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28493[/td][td align=left]19[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28571[/td][td align=left]19[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28089 (given by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=44640)[/td][td align=left]19[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28572[/td][td align=left]24[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28619 (given by https://www.wowhead.com/object=207279 in Hillsbrad)[/td][td align=left]24[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28688[/td][td align=left]24[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28532[/td][td align=left]24[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28548[/td][td align=left]29[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28549[/td][td align=left]29[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=left]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28704[/td][td align=left]2