            author = "Fuzzbutt",
            text = "I can't do spoiler markups in replies, so here's the explanation for \"they\" versus \"she\" that the first comment is complaining about.\n\n[spoiler]Jan'alai can be reborn as either male or female, which is why one of her epitaphs is 'mistress and master of the flame.' Characters use 'they' before the rebirth because the gender is currently indeterminate, like an unborn baby. Once Jan'alai is reborn specifically as female in this cycle, the characters switch to using 'she.'[/spoiler]",
            date = "2026-03-21T16:28:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86808#comments:id=6313757",
